  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.AnotherNeckPeck": "[pg][say:Thank you.] Another peck on your neck. Her arms pull tight around you, and she straightens herself a little to put her cheek to yours, getting comfortable in the mutual embrace."
  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.CouldDoAllDay": "[pg]You could well be doing this for the rest of the [day], but eventually, you have to drag it towards an end. You manage to rouse, but she doesn't seem to want to let go, and instead presses her lips against your cheek before travelling the short distance to your mouth. Opening up, you welcome the kiss and let her explore you at her leisure while you steadily untangle yourself from her many limbs and inch away. When you finally do break the embrace, her eyes appear as longingly bottomless as a frozen ocean for just a moment before they drift down to your [chest], then away as she remembers herself. With a [if (singleleg) {slink|step}] back, you give the seamstress a bit of space[if (!isnakedupper) { and rearrange your [if (hasarmor) {[armor]|[uppergarment]}]}]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.GiggleEscapes": "[pg]A giggle escapes her when you ease a hand through her blonde hair and lightly scratch behind her ear, accompanied by more than a dozen fingertips briefly dancing across your back in a ticklish flurry. You're still well-conscious of the undead girl's small, naked bust joined with yours, but your simmering blood has cooled somewhat, allowing you to enjoy the simple bliss of hugging her while letting your hands caress, stroke, and tease her as they please. Her own pulse, too, has calmed much and is now setting a slow, gentle rhythm on the edge of your awareness that leaves you more pacified than aroused despite the nude and intimate nature of your snuggle. Breathing in, you squeeze her a little tighter."
  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.ProperlySettledIn": "[pg]Now having properly settled in, Marielle seems content with just using your warmer body as something to rest against, and you indulge the seamstress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.RosinessReturns": "[pg]A hint of rosiness on her pale face again, she pulls her dress up[if (hasarmor) { as well}] and pats it down before absent-mindedly massaging her thighs. You had been occupying them for quite some time, though she seems hardly bothered by it, even as dainty as she looks. Marielle's grey-blue gaze then finally settles on you once more as she adjusts her glasses, a happy glitter in it that evidences the buoyant mood you've elevated her into--embarrassment notwithstanding--if her warm expression weren't already proof enough."
  "Scenes.Marielle.BoobPlayAgree.TemptingButStay": "Well, tempting as it may be to go further, you don't mind staying like this, either. She nestles into you when you put that to words, the smile on her lips unmistakable even if you can't see it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.BetterIdea": "You have a better idea, one she'll probably enjoy just as much."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.CooAppreciation": "[pg]You coo out your appreciation, praising the affectionate zombie by squeezing her hand and returning to petting her while you let yourself be treated like a living [god]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.CoolTongueDancing": "[pg]The cool tongue dancing and flicking across your nipple, the soft lips contracting around it in a slow rhythm, the pair of bright-blue eyes that peer upwards to gauge your every reaction, then the dainty hand that seeks yours, grasps it, and intertwines with it while another begins to lightly massage your other boob--Marielle seems utterly fixated on giving you the most comfortable experience possible as she suckles from you. And it's working. It's working incredibly well; you could melt right now, and [if (isgoo) {you nearly do that quite literally, but you force yourself to stay grounded enough to retain your current form. It's well worth the effort. When|when}] the sound of her finally swallowing the first mouthful of milk--[i:your] milk--graces your ears, it's the icing to it all, one that runs like the sweetest cream through your synapses right down to the very [if (tailLeg) {tip of your tail|[if (ishoofed) {bottom of your feet|tips of your toes}]}]. Content, you close your eyes and hold her to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.CouldntComplain": "[pg]Not that you could complain. The way she so attentively begins to kiss your sensitive teat once again is [if (corruption < 33) {positively|oddly}] fulfilling in its own right."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.CourseOfMinutes": "[pg]Over the course of the next thrilling minutes, the girl's fingers have traipsed seemingly everywhere at once: your nape, your arms, your chest, your waist, your [legs]... The distractions are so aplenty that you only heed the hand that has snuck down [if (haslowergarment) {into your [lowergarment]|[if (hasarmor) {into the lower parts of your [armor]|towards your nethers}]}] when it ever-so-lightly passes over your clit, causing you to unloose a low moan and press your head into the cloth pillow Marielle provided. Straight through your soaked inner folds she then slides, punctuating her motions with a more forceful suck, but stops just shy of your entrance. No penetration comes, nor is she in any rush to get you off--however effortless a task that would be in your current state. Instead, her nimble fingers retreat and start to focus on your feminine mound as a whole, giving you a massage with such measured artistry that you unconsciously writhe and undulate your hips into her every touch."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.FansHerself": "[pg][say:Hahh... My, ah, uhm... Hm.] Marielle fans herself with one hand, then picks the pince-nez off her nose to occupy herself with cleaning them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.FingersPlayCheek": "[pg]Wordlessly, you let your fingers play across Marielle's cheek as you swivel to recline backwards against the table. The motion rouses and shifts her from where she was resting, ultimately depositing her head on your naked bosom when you've made yourself as comfortable as you can in your new half-lying position. She certainly doesn't appear to mind being there, though she does look up at you in tacit question."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.HaveYouBegins": "[pg][say:Have you...] she begins, though is easily abstracted by having her earlobe caressed to make her body shake in a light chuckle. The girl is downright dreamy by the time you've rub by little rub directed her towards your awaiting nipple, requiring no further coaxing to latch onto it with a sweet kiss. That's it, that's just what you needed--already, you can feel the let-down of milk on its very verge, presaged by a anticipative tingling sensation deep within as Marielle speckles her light, languid sucking with short pecks and licks all around your areola. Your yearned-for relief so close, you lace your fingers through her silken hair, and when it finally begins to flow forth, the soft sigh on your lips transforms into a moan that reverberates through your soul."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.LostSenseOfTime": "[pg]You're pretty sure you've lost any sense of time by the point her fingers glide down your sides, and with your throat vibrating in a hum and her lips sealed around your throbbing teat, you follow the calm lead that Marielle takes. Things of steel and cloth are being swiped away behind you as you're guided backwards, up onto the sturdy sewing table. More shuffling, something soft cushioning your neck, her slight weight settling atop your lower body. [if (tallness > 72) {It's a little cramped here, but she still manages to make enough room for both of you in between|There's somehow a good bit of room for you here, despite}] the many sewing utensils and miscellaneous items strewn all around you, and you find yourself relaxing and unwinding with ease."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.MilkOnCheek": "[pg]She also looks like she's got some milk on her cheek. Foregoing any words, you stretch to scoop the streak up with your thumb and deliver it between those pretty lips. A giggle escapes her as soon as your finger leaves them again. She tries to mask it, but it bubbles on underneath the surface, in short order overtaking her, brimming over, and shaking her slender body, at which point it proves to be quite contagious before she turns away in sheer embarrassment, shielding her burning face until the bout passes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.MindfulAttentions": "[pg]Her mindful attentions aren't tantalizing, at least not frustratingly so, but somehow manage to be [if (corruption < 33) {positively|oddly}] fulfilling."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.MotherWhisper": "[pg][say:A mother,] she says to herself in a whisper, then continues louder for your ears, [say:I-I was not aware you{0}] You quickly ease her worries{1}and tell her to get her lips back to where you want them; you're feeling pretty abandoned. [say:Oh, ah... yes. Yes, of... of course.] The ageless seamstress seems awfully jumbled by the fact that you're lactating, [if (ischild) {{a confusion that's evidently exacerbated by how young you are|and you're not entirely sure why}}]. Nonetheless, she does get back on track, although you notice she now treats your body with an added ounce of hesitant gentleness, as if any wrong touch might somehow break you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.MouthLetsUp": "[pg]When her mouth lets up, though, you crack open your eyelids. Marielle is straddling you, the lamplight's warmth presenting you with a lovely picture of her nude, nubile upper body as she trails little kisses across your [skinfurscales]. Her velvety hair drapes behind, obscuring some of that view, so you reach to swipe one side behind her ear. She looks up, catches your gaze, and her eyes crinkle into a smile as she closes in on your yet-untapped boob before enwrapping its [nipple] and trapping it against her gum to coax out the tingly flow of milk. A quiver jolts through your system in its wake."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.OrgasmBreaksFree": "[pg]When your orgasm breaks free, it doesn't so much as [i:hit] you as it does comfortingly [i:immerse] your body, like the tranquil tide of a deep, calm ocean. You're faintly aware that you're moaning out loud and arching your back as it washes over you in gratifying pulses, releasing squirts of milk across the girl's cold tongue with the cadence of your [vagina]'s contractions, but there's nothing urgent or hectic about any of it--just great, gentle waves of shivering euphoria that let you savor Marielle's full-bodied embrace, her sweetly suckling lips, her talented fingers' rubs and strokes, and the blissful light-headedness that arrives in the eventual ebb of your climax."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.PauseAtLactating": "[pg]Once again, she's given pause. Something about the fact that you're lactating must be flustering the seamstress on an unusually deep level, though it's not enough to make her stop dead in her tracks this time. With a good bit of perhaps needless gentleness, she continues on to thoughtfully kiss your sensitive teat, drawing more of your white bounty out of you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.SatisfiedSigh": "[pg]Breathing a satisfied sigh, you surface back into the world around you. You're dizzy, quivering, lethargic, but still does a slight shift in weight and the seamstress's face appearing in your vision draw your sluggish attention towards her. A pair of lips moves as if to speak, but she then simply smiles at you as she leans down to plant a swift kiss on your cheek before sitting herself up, looking about as giddy and content as you are."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.SoothingRelief": "[pg]The soothing sensation of your chest being relieved of its heaviness blends seamlessly into the even more intimate stimulation below to form a truly mesmerically sensual experience; it's become increasingly difficult to make out the sounds of her quiet swallows and soft smacks above your own shallow, sultry breaths, and you've long lost track of where her other two hands are, though they do supply you with endless reminders of their existence."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.StartlesDrawsAway": "[pg]Though as soon as it does, the girl startles and draws away in a jerk, defying your hand's best efforts to keep her in place. With ever wider-growing eyes, she observes the trickle of white dribbling down over your [skindesc], where it starts to seep away unconsumed."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed.TelltaleTightening": "[pg]All throughout, a telltale tightening, uplifting warmth is oozing from your core, spreading out through your extremities until you feel like you're afloat several inches above the table's wooden surface, the one constant anchor to materiality being that of your conjoined palms. But you don't fight the current, you only welcome it with one final, deep gulp of air."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.FingersStopHeartbeats": "[pg][say:Hmm?] The fingers stop, and it takes a few heartbeats for her to comprehend your question and blush accordingly. [say:A-Ah... Well, uhm, [if (biggesttitsize < 2) {'tis one bodily article in which we are cut in much-like fashion...[if (ischild) { Although yours may yet well, ah, blossom.}]|[if (biggesttitsize < 6) {they are, ah... of a marvellous shapeliness... yes.|they are rather... large. In mine old realm, a woman of your... bounteousness was a most selcouth sight.[if (ischild) { And you are to blossom yet farther...}]}]}]] Some more color rises to her cheeks at a thought she doesn't share. Instead, Marielle straightens up, swipes a strand of golden hair from her face, and says, [say:Though I deem not, ah, size]--she puts an odd stress on that word--[say:to be a maiden's greatest virtue. 'Tis, uhm... becomingness. For the sum of all, not but the blood and form, to flow good and well and true is the paven pith of pulchritude; I would proclaim it so...] Her fingertips resume their imaginary, titillating paths across your naked flesh, the girl's gaze enthralled by their course."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.HandOnYours": "[pg]You feel the girl lay one of her own hands on yours, simply keeping it there. Then, after a while when she must be done cleaning her glasses, there are two more, starting out where she's straddling your waist and gradually wandering higher over your [skinfurscales] until they arrive at your [if (isflat) {flat boobs|[chest]}]. Her touch is light and aimless, as if done without much thought, but it still feels nice enough that you quietly hum as she strokes your emptied chest. She's staying there, drawing indistinct shapes over and around your nipples. Cracking open an eye, you ask if she likes them, your tits."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.HumsQuiteFine": "[pg][say:Hmm?] she hums into you. [say:Oh, yes, yes, I am quite... fine. I warrant thee.] A kiss on the neck, perhaps for emphasis, followed by a final four-limbed cuddle before she surfaces and pulls her dress up, looking considerably happy with the world. [say:Shall we, then? Liberate the hapless old walnut from its burthen, that is.] That you do, getting off the table to massage your muscles and stretch your [legs]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.NiceViewStraddling": "It's a nice view, the distracted, half-naked girl straddling you, and one you don't hesitate to take advantage of."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.NoHurryToRise": "You're in no hurry to get up--you'd rather just stay like this for a little bit longer and breathe, so you lazily rest a hand on Marielle's thigh and close your eyes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.PokesAreola": "[pg][say:Why well, but yours... {0}.] She pokes your areola for a final time before she hastily withdraws with a near-silent [say:Ah], pulls her dress up, and offers you a hand. Or rather, three of them. [say:Shall we, uhm, rise? The old walnut would thank us for it.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.RouseHastilyFinishes": "[pg]When you rouse, Marielle hastily finishes and scoots backwards to let you rise. A bit too hastily perhaps, as she stumbles when her dress falls past her hips and catches her legs, though your presence of mind prevents the accident from happening by way of a quick grab, and you steady her as you both get off the table. The dark wood creaks in appreciation behind you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.StrengthSuckedOut": "[pg]By the time you separate, it's like you've sucked all strength out of her: her arms drape slack over your body and her face sinks down into the crook of your neck, where she draws a deep breath that tickles your [skinshort]. You have to wonder if she's all right."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.TakeProfferedHands": "[pg]You take the proffered hands let the seamstress help you up."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.ThankYouPullsUp": "[pg][say:...Thank you, [name],] the girl says while she pulls up her shoulder straps, her rosy face mere inches from yours. [say:For all, I mean. 'Tis odd to be thus... nursed]--her lower pair of hands slides to your waist--[say:yet, ah, sits it right well upon the spirits. An aliment the gods themselves would uneath forlend.] [if (intelligence < 90) {Whatever she just said, it sounded positive|You're pretty sure that was a high compliment to your milk's taste}], and her heartfelt smile aspires to attest to that as she lets go."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.TimeToGetUp": "Well, it's about time to get up, you think."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Breastfeed2.TooLittleTime": "[pg]Giving her too little time to react, you slide your hands over Marielle's back as you swiftly sit up and pull her into a kiss. What surprise she tries to express is quickly drowned in your forthright advance, her glasses clattering onto the wood as she forsakes them in favor of slinging her arms around you. Her eyes are closed, her lips open just wide enough to grant your tongue entry. As expected, the sweet taste of your milk overpowers all else, but neither of you lets go as you share breaths and squeezes while you make out with the pale, undead seamstress turning into a gluttonous, needy blob of jelly in your lap.[if (isgoo) { And you thought you were the only one here.}]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionBack.TurnBackToChests": "You turn back to the two large, opened chests of apparel and underwear."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.ABedSheet": "[say:A bed sheet?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.ChaosMakesSense": "[pg]What looks like relative chaos to you must make perfect sense to her, as she swiftly singles out a box underneath many others to pull free and search through, and ultimately comes up with a sizeable roll of what you assume to be silk-thread. The colors match when she places it next to the bundle. It feels pretty similar, too. Though you wonder if this will alter the texture in any way."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.CommissionBedding": "[pg]Do you want to commission the bedding?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.FrownSimpleEnough": "[pg][say:Well, uhm... certainly, 'tis simple enough. But are-- hmm...] The frown on her face betrays that she isn't too sympathetic to your request, but the longer she considers it in silence, the more does that expression ease away [if (metdolores) {and eventually turn into a soft smile as|before}] she nods, folds the silk, and produces a pencil and a piece of paper."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.FullSetBedclothes": "[pg]You probably need more than that; you were thinking of a full set of bedclothes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.ProvideProportions": "[pg]You provide Marielle with all the necessary proportions and how exactly you want the bedding to look while she writes down what you tell her. There isn't really that much to discuss, but you do ask for the price."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.SatinAfterAll": "[pg][say:By a margin right most minute. 'Twill be satin, after all.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.ThreeHundredGems": "[pg][say:300 gems.] That was a quick answer. [say:'Twill be needful to, ah, withal enweave a silk of different birth, lest but a single sheet could I present you... Oh, it shall be of no lesser quality, I warrant you. A moment.] Getting up from her stool, the seamstress sets her notes down and grabs a piece of white fabric to compare it to your daughter's cocoon, murmuring, [say:Hmm, I see.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBedding.WhatMeasureShape": "[pg][say:What, ah, measure and shape will it need be?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.ClothOfVariance": "[pg][say:Oh, pray pardon. 'Tis a cloth of vast variance, but, uhm...] Scanning her desk, the girl takes up several loose threads and weeds out nine of them to stretch between one pair of hands, vertically, then picks up some striking yellow yarn as she starts to explain."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.FreeingFingersQuestion": "[pg]While she's freeing up her fingers again, the question remains whether you want to commission the bedding."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.NowYouKnow": "[pg]Well, now you know. You thank the seamstress for the illustration, eliciting a pleased smile and a dip of her head as she undoes the weaving."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.UnfamiliarAskSatin": "You're unfamiliar with the subject, leading you to ask how it being satin has any impact."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.WarpBorneAloft": "[pg][say:Thus the warp, for which I your daughter's silk would use, is borne aloft, 'floated', so to speak, and all but by itself fashions the fabric's face.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingElaborate.WarpFloatingWeave": "[pg][say:In its outmost frame, silken satin is a, ah, 'warp-floating' weave. For every filament by the weft inwoven]--she passes the yarn over the first string--[say:many more are then by turns underdolven.] She skips underneath the next four, only surfacing on the sixth just to go right under again. On the last, Marielle hoops around it and repeats that process back and forth a few more times to create a pattern that is still mostly made up of vertical lines, only occasionally interrupted. You think you're getting the picture."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingNo.TurnDownBedding": "You [if (gems < 300) {don't actually have that kind of money|changed your mind}], so you turn down the seamstress's offer. She simply nods."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingNo.VeryWellWishAught": "[pg][say:Hmm. Well... Very well. Wish you for aught else, then?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingYes.DoneInGoodTime": "[pg][say:Done it shall be in good time,] she says, lowering into a curtsy. [say:And till that time be, [name], I pray you, be safe.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingYes.LookForwardProduct": "You'll look forward to seeing the finished product, then. In the process of counting gems, you ask how long she'll take. The back of her pencil taps lightly against her hand in thought."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingYes.ReturnFarewellExit": "[pg]After returning the farewell, you exit the temple and let the girl begin to work on your bedclothes. You make a mental note to come back here once she's finished."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingYes.TwoDaysMayhap": "[pg][say:Two days, mayhap. Belike less.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothBeddingYes.TwoFullDays": "[pg]You should make that two full days, then. The seamstress nods once more, accepts her payment, and stands up with you when you get ready to leave."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.AllSheUtters": "[pg]It's all she utters at first, two hands occupying themselves with the tips of her hair as Marielle eyes you up and down. Gradually, the corners of her pale lips curve upwards, lending her a more and more pleased character [if (metdolores) {until she breaks out into a broad, gleeful grin. Though with a hem, she quickly catches herself and steers it into a more subdued smile|that she rounds out with a bobbed nod}]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.ClassicInMind": "[pg]You had something classic in mind--long, flowing, elegant. Something that will {0}. While the girl takes notes on what you said, you inquire how much a garment like that would cost; the raw material may be provided by you, but a ripped-open cocoon is far from a finished dress. Again, she sounds nothing more than a hum, staring down at her paper, circling her graphite pencil above it, and casting an occasional glance at you. You feel like you're being measured, though you're not sure by what metric."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.CommissionDress": "[pg]Do you want to commission the dress?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.HmmOnly": "[pg][say:Hmm.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.SixFiftyGems": "[pg][say:650 gems,] Marielle concludes. There still seems to be a thought flitting through her head, and she does write down a few words more, but doesn't add anything else to her statement."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.ThoughtWellConceived": "[pg][say:Aye, a[if (metdolores) {, ah,}] thought most well-conceived.] Adjusting her glasses before reaching for pencil and paper, the seamstress then asks, [say:The gown, in what, ah, manner envisage you it?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDress.WantDress": "You'd like a dress, for your own wardrobe."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressNo.DifferentVestment": "[pg][say:Hmm. Well... Very well. Would you wish for a different vestment, then?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressNo.TurnDownDress": "You [if (gems < 650) {don't actually have that kind of money|changed your mind}], so you turn down the seamstress's offer. Her shoulders fall a little."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.FiveDaysNote": "[pg]Five days. You make a mental note to return here after that."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.FullBodyPortrayals": "[pg]In the end, you come out with several full-body portrayals of your very own self wearing a dress that surpasses even the one you had initially pictured, a few close-ups regarding the more intricate areas, and a whole jungle of notes she made all around them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.GlimpsesPapers": "[pg]She glimpses at her papers, then at your daughter's silk sitting on the table, and says, [say:Five days. Five days, in dueful diligence, and it shall all be done.] Sounds like she has a good bit of work in front of her. The seamstress gives a smile as she takes off her glasses for a cleaning. [say:More pleasure than labor.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.GoOverOnceMore": "[pg]You go over it all once more, and find yourself satisfied. This is it. You convey that to Marielle, bringing a pleased lightness to her face, and ask how long she'll take for everything."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.HoldYouSoAwhile": "[pg][say:Now, I prithee, hold you so awhile,] she says, and you readily obey the pale seamstress, following along with her nudged instructions while she takes your sizes, which turn out to be legion. Fingers, wrists, elbows, shoulders, chest,[if (haswings) { wings,}] waist, hips, [if (singleleg) {[if (tailLeg) {tail|lower body}]|legs}], and many more. Even your neck and jaw are gauged and noted down in quick, efficient motions before you're let off."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.HoursOnChest": "[pg]You don't know how much time you spend on that chest, talking to Marielle. There's a lot that goes into a dress, making you understand some of the stranger measurements she's taken, and it also quickly becomes apparent why one sheet of paper wouldn't suffice. Marielle is a good illustrator though, and despite her antiquated language and use of technical terms, her sheer knowledge and experience are able to smoothly guide you through the process, tell you what will and will not work, and give suggestions that you more often than not find yourself agreeing with."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.QuiteWellMurmurs": "[pg][say:Quite well, quite well,] she murmurs. [say:Ah, please, here, sit]--on her way back to her stool, the girl shuts the sturdy dress-chest and motions you to take a seat on it--[say:and let us speak of more.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.TakeHerWord": "[pg]You'll take her word for it, then, and leave her to get started. Your parting pleasantries are matched with a cutely curtsied, [say:Quite likewise, [name]. Fare you well upon your journeys,] before you take on the trip through mud and morass back home."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothDressYes.WorthItToYou": "That's worth it to you. You count the gems and hand them over to Marielle, who has meanwhile gathered some more paper and seems keen to get to business. She only cursorily glances through the pouch and sets it aside before picking up a measuring tape."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.BrowsRiseAjar": "[pg][say:...Huh?] Marielle's brows rise, her lips ajar to reveal a white sliver of her teeth. [say:No more but... that?] You clarify you merely wanted panties, nothing else. [say:Oh, uhm, [if (femininity >= 59) {w-}]well... 'Tis, ah...] Gathering her wits again, she casts an emphatic glance towards the pile of moth-silk. [say:'Tis a foison that eath out-feeds any such, uhm... scantling article.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.CommissionPanties": "[pg]Do you want to commission the pair of panties?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.DescribeCutTightness": "[pg]You briefly describe what kind of panties you had in mind--their general cut, tightness, and your wish you keep the color an unaltered white. All the while, the pale girl listens and pens down what you tell her, humming faintly in acknowledgement once you're done. A few written words more, and she looks up at you, her pencil poised. The seconds pass, only dotted with the tweets of various birds somewhere above you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.GazesAtSilk": "[pg]Marielle doesn't immediately reply with anything, and instead just gazes at your daughter's cocoon for a while before her eyes switch to you, a shade of [if (isfemale) {vacillation|worry}] within their wintry depths. [say:Well...] she says at last, but lets that fade again. After another moment of unvoiced thoughts, the seamstress seems to come to a conclusion, nods, turns, and produces a pencil and a piece of paper."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.MannerOfUndergarments": "[pg][say:Well...] she tries a second time, [say:what, ah, manner of undergarments bethought you yourself of?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.PencilTapsHand": "[pg][say:Hmm...] The pencil stops, only to then tap against her hand instead. [say:Well, am I to retain what superfluous shall be, then not a thing more. If 'tis truly what you wish.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.TiltsHeadLeft": "[pg][say:Uhm...] She lightly tilts her head to the left. [say:Aught else, [name]?] No, nothing, you tell her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.UseMoreCloth": "[pg]Surely there are some ways to use up a little more cloth than usual--you want them to be as comfortable as possible, after all[if (!nofur && silly) {, just like your other diapers}]. And everything that's left over afterwards, she could just keep. While the girl ponders your proposal with her piece of graphite idly circling above the paper, you ask her what it would cost, anyway."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPanties.WantMothPanties": "You'd like some underwear; material like that ought to feel incredible."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesNo.ChangedMindOffer": "You changed your mind, so you take back your offer. She simply nods."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesNo.VeryWellAughtElse": "[pg][say:Very well. Wish you for aught else, then?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesYes.ADayMostLike": "[pg][say:A day, most like.] She pauses, taps her desk, and nods again. [say:Aye, a day.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesYes.HaveDeal": "You have a deal, then. Marielle nods, reaching for a tape and another piece of paper as she gets up. [say:Quite well. Pray you, now, hold as so awhile.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesYes.LetHerMeasure": "[pg]You let the seamstress measure your lower body, her secondary set of hands busy writing down everything she'll need before she rises again. Murmuring to herself as she steps away, she shuts the large dress-chest and motions you to take a seat on it. Together, you then spend the next half-hour or so working out the minute details of your panties-to-be, their different possible variations in design, the style and extent of their ornamentation, and of course the properties--chiefly texture--of the textile the young moth's silk will be woven into. Marielle's knowledge and experience show as she, antiquated language notwithstanding, smoothly guides you through everything until she at last presents you with several intricate drawings of a pair of panties that you think you're a hundred percent content with."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesYes.ThusShallBe": "[pg][say:Thus it shall be, then,] the girl says, head bobbing, when you voice your approval. It all turned into a fairly elaborate thing, so you ask how long it'll take to make it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionMothPantiesYes.TightDeadline": "[pg]Sounds like a tight deadline to you, but you trust the seamstress to know herself best. With that in mind and looking forward to seeing the end result, you take your leave from Marielle, drawing a smiling curtsy and a, [say:Fare you well, [name],] out of her before you exit the derelict, overgrown temple to get yourself back to camp."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionReturn.ConsiderWhatElse": "You consider what else to do."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBedding.CastInFull": "[pg]She gives a nod, turning the bundle about in her grasp. [say:As you wish. Cast in full hereof?] In the moment it takes you to think, she elaborates, [say:Of this very silk, I mean, and not complected with a filament further{0}.] You'd want it to be pure spider-silk, if possible, though that question alone already tells you one unit won't be enough. You ask for the number."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBedding.CommissionBedding": "[pg]Do you want to commission the bedding?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBedding.DescribeBedAtCamp": "[pg]You briefly go over what you had pictured and what your bed at camp is like while she listens to your descriptions, quiet except for the featly scratching of graphite on paper, until she seems to have a good idea of all she'll require. [say:Aye, a half-dozen, then... and eke 380 gems,] Marielle concludes, adjusting her rounded glasses as she glances up to await your final word."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBedding.HalfDozenSuffice": "[pg][say:Hmm... A half-dozen ought suffice, or, well]--her unoccupied hands reach for something to write--[say:what need you, in precise?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBedding.SoundsLikeGoodIdea": "{0} doesn't sound like a b[if (silly) {{e|a}}]d idea, so your request to Marielle is for exactly that: bedclothes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingNo.NotEnoughBundles": "[if (SSbundles < 6) {You don't have enough silk for|[if (gems < 380) {You don't have enough money for|You changed your mind about}]}] that, so you turn down the seamstress's offer, which she meets with a light nod."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingNo.PageVeryWell": "[pg][say:Very well.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.AsksAllInOrder": "[pg][say:All in order?] Marielle asks when she lets you have a last look at the notes and sketches she's been taking all throughout. You can't find anything to object to, so you give her the green light and get ready to depart. [say:Very well, then, very well... Oh, a day or twain 'twill take--no more, I warrant.] Two days. You'll be looking forward to the end result."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.EstimatesComeQuick": "[pg]It doesn't take terribly long to either remember or give good estimates of the more exact measurements before you move on to talk about matters of design, texture, and the fabric's general qualities. You follow most of her advice, though options and hands-on examples does she give you aplenty, which drags out the whole process a little. Not that you mind; getting this kind of unrestricted service out here in a rancid bog in the middle of nowhere is pretty fantastic."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.FinalWordBusiness": "Well, your final word is that she just got herself some business. You get to picking out the necessary gems and silk bundles, all of which your undead tailor accepts in a gracious and eager mien."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.MayItDispleaseYou": "[pg][say:May it displease you not,] she says with an incline of her head that she smoothly converts into a parting curtsy. [say:Adieu, [name], Graces grant you safety.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.MomentMoreConference": "[pg][say:A, uhm, moment more in conference, if we may,] she suggests, one hand indicating a chest large enough to comfortably recline on, [say:and please sit you, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBeddingYes.NotSureSafe": "[pg]You're not so sure they could keep you safe from all the gnats and other little bloodsuckers outside. If they can, they aren't doing it. Still, you're almost used to the buzzing and biting by now, and perhaps one day, they'll finally have drank their fill."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBra.CommissionBra": "[pg]Do you want to commission the bra?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBra.PeersMeasuring": "[pg][say:A brassiere? Hmm, very well.] Marielle peers at you, clearly measuring you with her eyes, then down at the bundle in her hands, weighing it. [say:Another hereof shall be of necessity foremost, then, withal...] A second--{0} professional--glance at your chest. [say:230 gems.] Seems like she doesn't need any more information to form that assessment. Nothing you could still change about the material of course, but you suppose that leaves you with a sort-of blank cheque for the exact design and finer details."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBra.WantFittedBra": "You'd like a bra--one fitted perfectly to you and your personal tastes, as you{0} she can do"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBraNo.TurnDownBra": "[if (SSbundles < 2) {You don't have enough silk for|[if (gems < 230) {You don't have enough money for|You changed your mind about}]}] that, so you turn down the seamstress's offer. She merely nods in acknowledgement."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBraYes.AllInAccord": "[pg][say:Certainly. All in accord?] Marielle asks when you wrap things up, delivering the finalized sketch into your hands for your review. It's unpretentious, tasteful, yet rather enticing, if you say so yourself. [say:...No more than a day, peace permitting, will't take.] She's watching you when you look up from the paper, her head tilted ever so slightly to the side until she receives your nod of acknowledgement with a {0} bow. A day doesn't sound too long; you'll make sure to be back when she's done. But for now, it's time to say your goodbye and allow the seamstress that 'peace' she mentioned, a decision she seems to appreciate, bidding you a, [say:Good [if (hours > 20) {{night|[if (hours > 17) {{even|day}}]}}], and safest travels,] before you get on your way to brave the swamp for a trip home."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBraYes.PlanBraSpecifics": "[pg]Over the following minutes, you two plan out your future bra's specifics, helped along by measurements and illustrations that quickly give it the shape you had imagined until you think you can leave it at that and let her own discretion fill in the rest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBraYes.ReadyToStart": "You're ready to get right into it; you do have the time and money."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderBraYes.SplendidStandsUp": "[pg][say:Why, splendid,] she says, and stands up, her left pair of hands already collecting what she'll need from the table: paper, pencil, tape measures. [say:A, ah, license and a moment, if you please.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.AskCost": "[pg]You do however want to know how much it would cost you, and whether she needs any additional silk--a single piece can hardly be enough for all that. She casts a glance at the wound-up fibers, one hand caressing a length of hair while another reaches to take back the drawing you're offering."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.CommissionDress": "[pg]Do you want to commission the dress?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.ElegantDressInMind": "Here's what you had in mind: an elegant dress, but one that isn't afraid of showing some skin and has a bit of a magical spin to it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.FiveHundredGems": "[pg][say:Four more shall suffice, withal... uhm... hmm, 500 gems,] she says, setting everything down to await your answer."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.LikeSoMayhap": "[pg][say:Like so, then, mayhap?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.PaperPencilReady": "[pg]Marielle already has some paper and a pencil in hand when you finish giving her the general outline, writing something down in silence for a while until she stops, taps against her notes, and murmurs, [say:'Magical', say you...] before then directing her next words in a more audible voice at you. [say:Well, a webstress I am, howbeit not one of spells. If it be glamors you seek, then not I, but a, ah... witch-weaver or alchemist ought you employ.] You {0}. She makes nothing more than a [say:Hm] at that, but the accentuated curve of her mouth tells you she's definitely pleased to hear it. Another short silence ensues, owing to her putting down a few strokes more until she, seemingly satisfied, leans back a little to better contemplate whatever she drafted, bobs her head, and holds the paper out to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDress.TwoPortraits": "[pg]Two portraits of a [if (biggesttitsize < 3) {graceful|[if (biggesttitsize < 6) {shapely|curvaceous}]}] woman with a rather impressive hairdo greet you, though it's likely the dress she's wearing that Marielle wants you to consider. It's long, around ankle-length. The neckline sits low and has almost vacated the shoulders entirely, presenting a good bit of cleavage in front while leaving the better parts of the back bare as well, though with the widening, flounced sleeves and wavy skirt, that's about the extent of what's exposed. There's also some sort of bow or sash tightened around the waist. It looks quite comfortable, and despite that being only the first sketch, you don't have all that much to add to it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressNo.DifferentGarment": "[pg][say:Well, uhm, would you then wish for a different garment?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressNo.TurnDownDress": "[if (SSbundles < 5) {You don't have enough silk for|[if (gems < 500) {You don't have enough money for|You changed your mind about}]}] that, so you turn down the seamstress's offer. She bobs her head again, her [say:Hmm] this time sounding a bit more ponderous."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.AgreedWonderful": "[pg][say:Ah, we are agreed? Why, wonderful,] Marielle lilts when you hand it all over, a pair of tape measures and a fresh few papers at the ready as she rises. [say:Then let us make waste of not a minute more. I prithee, [name], keep right as so.] Standing still and following her instructions, you let the eager seamstress take measurement after measurement after measurement--by the time she's done and bids you to take a seat on the sturdy wooden trunk, you're sure she could sculpt a perfect clay-image of you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.CurtsyInterlaces": "[pg][say:Likewise, 'tis my pleasure.] Her characteristic curtsy dipped, she interlaces the whole twenty of her fingers. [say:Be you well, fare you well, and erelong repair you well.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.FinalLookOver": "[pg][say:Is't all in favors with your fancies?] she asks, letting you have a final look-over of the finished drawings."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.HumEyesOnReels": "[pg]A thoughtful hum, her eyes making their perch upon the reels of spider-thread stacked on her desk. [say:The soonest in three or... Nay, four days,] Marielle eventually says. [say:By the full of four days, if it please you.] You're not going to hold her any longer, then, thanking her as you get your things and take your leave."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.MoreStylishBefore": "[pg]It's... somewhat more stylish than before. Embroidery adorns the already-sumptuous silk, the sleeves fan out a bit wider, the skirt now rises a little at the front, and the neckline's cut has been meticulously adjusted to complement your [if (isfeminine || !isflat) {bust|chest}] to what should be perfection. Overall, it seems more mystical and [if (isfeminine) {witch|mage}]-like, for lack of a better word. You reiterate your approval and ask when you should be coming back to pick it up."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.RefineDesign": "[pg]After you're both settled in comes the design's refinement. Ideas are exchanged, details are sketched and re-sketched, and as the minutes pass under her helpful guidance and quick illustrations, your soon-to-be dress takes on an ever more complete shape until you reach a point where you can safely say you're content with it. The rest, you'll leave up to Marielle."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.TakeDeal": "You'll take that deal, which you seal by unpacking the remaining silk bundles and counting the gems she asked for."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderDressYes.TryToDoThat": "[pg]You'll try to do that. The trip back home is a good start--the marshlands are peaceful, almost placid in spite of the abundant presence of toads and frogs along the way, and the somehow unshakeable feeling of some elusive creature's glare skewering you from afar."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.AskIfAnythingWrong": "[pg]When that's all that comes from her, you go ahead and ask if anything's wrong--if she needs more pieces, and what that would even cost."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.CommissionPanties": "[pg]Do you want to commission the pair of panties?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.GraphiteFlying": "[pg]You briefly describe what you want, her sharpened piece of graphite flying over the paper to the pace of your words, staying there for a few strokes more after you finish, then lifting up to tap against the girl's lower lip."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.HmmOnly": "[pg][say:Hmm...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.NonCommittalHmm": "[pg]Marielle receives your request with a non-committal [say:Hmm] at first, considering the material in her palms in silence before her head bobs, two hands reaching for pencil and paper, and she looks up at you to say, [say:Quite well. What conceives, pray tell?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.PencilKeepsMoving": "[pg][say:Hm, yes, one more, I ween,] Marielle says. The pencil doesn't stop its motion. [say:Withal... 230 gems.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPanties.WantSoftPanties": "You want her to make you some panties of the soft and snug-fitting variety."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesNo.TurnDownPanties": "[if (SSbundles < 2) {You don't have enough silk for|[if (gems < 230) {You don't have enough money for|You changed your mind about}]}] that, so you turn down the seamstress's offer. Her pencil finally halts when another [say:Hmm] comes out of her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesNo.WishAughtElse": "[pg][say:Well... Then, wish you for aught else?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesYes.AccurateDraft": "[pg]What she was sketching earlier turns out to be a pretty accurate draft of your imagined pair of panties, and you spend the next little while refining that design with her. It's rather relaxing, sitting there and watching Marielle put to paper what the both of you work out, though you've soon gone through everything you wanted, leaving you with nothing more to add."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesYes.AnotherBundle": "You take out another bundle, prompting a small [say:Ah] before you start counting the gems necessary for this commission. You're halfway through when Marielle slinks into your field of vision, holding a pair of measuring tapes and looking[if (tallness > 67) { up}] at you in wordless question, perhaps not wanting to further disrupt your tally. You signal her to go ahead as you continue. The girl's [if (femininity >= 59) {over-}]cautious touches are mildly distracting nonetheless, yet is it not long until you've both finished your business and she bids you to take a seat closer to her, upon the heavy dress-chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesYes.HoldTheyRegard": "[pg][say:Hold they your regard, [name]?] she asks, and you communicate that they do. [say:Why, splendid, then, right splendid. Will that be all?] That will indeed be all, but you do want to know how long she'll take. [say:'Twill be done apace, ere the lark sing twice.] In one day, you'll presume that means."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderPantiesYes.TakeLeave": "[pg]To not keep the seamstress any longer, you get up and take your leave from her, receiving a smile, a curtsy, and an, [say:Aye, fare you most well,] in return before you turn to leave the temple and take on the trip back towards your campsite."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwear.CommissionUnderwear": "[pg]Do you want to commission the underwear?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwear.FeaturesLightUp": "[pg]Her features lighting up, Marielle inclines her head and replies with a happy, [say:Why, at your pleasure, 'twere likewise mine to, ah, fashion pretties right befitting the {0} of ladies.] {1}, you call her back to the matter by asking for a price, and whether she'll need more of those bundles."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwear.HandsCongregate": "[pg][say:Ah.] Her unoccupied hands congregate atop the silk, the last one joining them there after nudging her glasses. [say:Aye, an addition of three, I ween, and 450 gems shall it come to.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwear.MatchingSet": "A set of matching underwear, consisting of a bra and a pair of panties tailored to your figure and tastes, is what you'd like to order."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearNo.HmmAughtElse": "[pg][say:Hmm. Aught else, then?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearNo.TurnDownUnderwear": "[if (SSbundles < 4) {You don't have enough silk for|[if (gems < 450) {You don't have enough money for|You changed your mind about}]}] that, so you turn down the seamstress's offer, her hand stroking the bundle like it were a kitten."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearYes.FareWellThroughBog": "[pg]You do fare rather well on your trip through the bog. The mosquitoes are a never-sated reminder of the marshlands' inhospitality, but you otherwise remain unharassed by the local wildlife."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearYes.FareYouWell": "[pg][say:Likewise, kind graces upon you, [name], and fare you well.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearYes.HalfHourMeasurements": "[pg]The next half-hour or so is then spent with taking various measurements, translating what you're imagining into proper drawings, discussing what details need to be discussed, and last but not least applying the finishing touches with small amendments, more measurements, and the choice of adornments. All in all a more involved process than you'd expect for something as simple as underwear, and when you're done, the seamstress cautions you to have a final look at the designs. They really are 'pretties', as she calls them--pretty enough now that you have no more wishes or thoughts to pile onto them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearYes.MarvellousChirps": "[say:Marvellous,] she chirps when you hand her the rest of what she's going to need. By the time you've also counted the asked-for gems, Marielle is already advancing on you with tapes, papers, and a pencil raised and at the ready."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSpiderUnderwearYes.NotAOne": "[pg][say:Not a one?] she asks upon your declaration, which you do reaffirm. [say:Quite well, then, quite well...] The corners of her mouth draw up while her fingertips trace over the paper for a moment longer before she looks at you and folds her hands. [say:Well, I shall have it all within the matter of, uhm, two days.] Sounds good to you. You stand, Marielle rising with you to dip into a[if (!insultedfather) {n elegant}] curtsy when you say your goodbye."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.AMothGirl": "[pg]A moth-girl, you say."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.CommissionDress": "[pg]Do you want to commission the dress?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.DifficultNoClothing": "[pg]It's made a little difficult by the fact that she doesn't wear clothing, but you've had some time to think about what would suit Sylvia best, and it should be what matches Marielle's own expertise quite well: something long, cascading, elegant. Something fairly classic, you'd say."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.DressAsGift": "You'd like a dress; not for yourself, but one intended as a gift."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.EyesTwinkle": "[pg][say:Oh?] The seamstress's eyes seem to almost twinkle at that, paying you full attention as she swivels to fetch a pencil and a piece of paper. [say:What is she that you ask it for?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.MakeTalkOfTrade": "[pg][say:Now then, let us make talk of trade--of cost, foremost. The, ah, gown, as you it envisage, what is't like? In few, I pray you.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.RuminatingNoWriting": "[pg][say:Hmm...] She looks ruminating down at her paper without writing anything, only moving the pencil in circles above it. [say:How tall stands she?] About [if (metric) {172 centimeters|five feet and eight inches}], you tell her, to which the seamstress mouths an [say:Ah] and nods as she finally pens something down. [say:Well, 600 gems or thereabouts, I ween, dependant of...] A glance at the bundle of silk has her trailing off for a second. [say:Nay, 600. Thereabouts begone.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.StumblesExhaleSigh": "[pg][say:No, I--] She stumbles. That exhale sounded more like a sigh. [say:I mean, [i:who] is't you ask it for?] Marielle then says in a much slower and clearer manner. You answer that by telling her it's for Sylvia, your moth [if (sylviadom >= 75) {mistress|lover}] and [if (metdolores) {Dolores' [if (isfeminine) {other }]mother|the [if (isfeminine) {other }]mother of the one whose silk that is}]. After a moment of silent consideration, the undead girl's smile [if (metdolores) {spreads wide, and a chuckle springs forth unrepressed, laying her thoughts bare even if she doesn't immediately speak them.|widens further, a hum accompanying the light bobbing of her head.}]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDress.WellBethoughtAffection": "[pg][say:Aye. Aye, most well-bethought affection,] she says in a bright voice. One hand runs over a tress of her hair, playing it around her fingers halfway through before she drops it and gets herself back to the crux of the matter."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressNo.OhVeryWell": "[pg][say:Oh. Well... Very well. Would you wish for a different vestment, then?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressNo.TurnDownDress": "You [if (gems < 600) {don't actually have that kind of money|changed your mind}], so you turn down the seamstress's offer. Her shoulders fall a little."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.CurvaceousMothPortrayals": "[pg]In the end, you come out with several full-body portrayals of a curvaceous moth in a dress that surpasses even the one you had initially pictured, a few close-ups regarding the more intricate areas, and a whole jungle of notes she made all around them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.DefinitelyWorthIt": "It's definitely worth that much to you. You count the gems and hand them over to Marielle, who has meanwhile procured some more paper and seems raring to dive right into the meat of your business. She only cursorily glances through the pouch and sets it aside."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.FiveDaysNote": "[pg]Five days. You make a mental note to return here after that."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.GlimpsesNotes": "[pg]She glimpses at her notes, then at your daughter's silk sitting on the table, and says, [say:Five days. Five days, in dueful diligence, and it shall all be done.] Sounds like she has a good bit of work in front of her. The seamstress gives a smile as she takes off her glasses for a cleaning. [say:More pleasure than labor.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.GoOverOnceMore": "[pg]You go over it all once more, and find yourself satisfied. This is it. You convey that to Marielle, bringing a pleased lightness to her face, and ask how long she'll take for everything."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.MoreExcitedThanYou": "[pg][say:Now, she knows not, yes? Of these purposes. Ah, please, here, sit, sit.] More excited than you are, the girl shuts the sturdy dress-chest and motions you to take a seat on it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.TakeHerWord": "[pg]You'll take her word for it, then, and leave her to get started. Your parting pleasantries are matched with a deeply curtsied, [say:Wholly likewise, [name]. Fare you well upon your journeys,] before you take on the trip through mud and morass back home."
  "Scenes.Marielle.CommissionSylviaDressYes.TimeOnChest": "[pg]You don't know how much time you spend on that chest, talking to the seamstress. There's a lot that goes into a dress, a lot of measurements to be taken, and in Sylvia's absence and with your intention to keep it a surprise, you have to provide all of them yourself. Thankfully, you're rather intimate with the moth's body. After that comes the design stage, and it quickly becomes apparent why one sheet of paper wouldn't suffice. Marielle is a good illustrator though, and despite her antiquated language and use of technical terms, her sheer knowledge and experience are able to smoothly guide you through the process, tell you what will and will not work, and give suggestions that you more often than not find yourself agreeing with."
  "Scenes.Marielle.FinishBath.FarewellGlance": "[pg]Throwing the still-bathing seamstress a glance and a farewell of your own, you step out of the temple, into the bog beyond. The way back to your campsite is uneventful, but notable for how strangely light and rejuvenated you feel. It's almost like you're still afloat in that tranquil pool."
  "Scenes.Marielle.FinishBath.HumsInDueTime": "[pg][say:Hmm...] she hums. [say:In due time, I shall... Ah, pray leave that upon the ground, 'tis no matter.] That last part was directed at your silently questioning gesture, so you lay the towel down right there before [if (!isnaked) {putting your [armor] back on|gathering your gear together}]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.FinishBath.PleasantFarewell": "[pg][say:Well, a pleasant [if (!isday) {night|day}] to you, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.FinishBath.RousedByExit": "[pg][say:Ah. You are leaving, [name]?] Marielle asks, roused by the sounds of your exit, while you reach for the towel she gave you earlier. It's luxuriously soft. You notice her eyes {0} as you dry yourself off, and you ask her if she won't get out as well."
  "Scenes.Marielle.FinishBath.TimeToFinish": "You think it's time to finish up, now. After giving yourself one final scrub-down, you rise up and pull yourself out of the pond, although with some lingering reluctance. The fresh temple air feels downright wintry after you've been soaking in this warm, soothing water."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.AnotherRiddle": "[pg][say:Well, perchance another riddle for another time. Although, ah...] Her head tilts to you. [say:Where came you by it?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.BuriedFaceSilent": "[pg]Marielle says nothing as she soundlessly buries her face in your [if (tallness > 71) {[chest]|[neck]}] and squeezes you, trembling, but clutching you tight. She does have quite some strength in those bony limbs of hers, you get to experience first-hand as she presses [if (tallness < 57) {you against her cold body|her cold body against yours}]. You stroke her back in turn, enjoying the long, unexpected, and conifer-scented hug from the usually so reserved and guarded seamstress. You'll take this as your 'thank you'."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.CertainerNod": "[pg][say:Not a thing certainer,] she says with a light nod. [say:The leaves, the bloom, the tinct... it all falls just right. I... Hmm.] Marielle gives it a testing prod and runs a few fingers through the thick-packed layers. They have by now near-fully unfurled, permitting her a thorough inspection of their intricacies."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.DemurralFizzles": "[pg][say:Hmm? A present? Oh, I pray you, 'tis quite unneedful for you to...] Her demurral fizzles out when her eyes fall upon the withered flower you've pulled out. Gradually widening, they stare transfixed at it, her pale lips cracking open but producing no sound as she hesitantly rises from her seat and steps closer, as if unable to believe what she sees."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.FirstMinuteGreen": "[pg]Within the first minute, you can already spot hints of green appear inside the greyish-brown labyrinth. Slowly, they spread out and multiply while the Anastatica uncurls bit by little bit, languidly stretching its branches like a fern until they spill over the bowl's lip and down onto the table as layer after greening layer sprouts from the previously tightly packed ball. What was moments ago an unassuming tumbleweed soon has opened up into a blooming seedbed of deep emerald, tiny white blossoms dotting its now-vivid leaves. It really does live up to all its names."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.FlowerOfStone": "[pg][say:...Flower of stone,] she whispers, barely above her breath. [say:It... It is forsooth, the very one.] Finally, she starts blinking again. Rapidly. [say:Where-- What-- Why-- Is that... me?] That didn't make sense, but you gather she's asking if it's for her, and you answer that by placing the plant into her hands, which she hastily outstretches."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.FoundStrangePlant": "Thinking that you may have found the strange plant her father was so fond of, you reach into your [pouch] and tell Marielle that you have something for her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.GnarledBallTouches": "[pg]As the gnarled ball touches her, the undead girl's mind appears to stop in its tracks altogether, and she stands gazing at the thing like she's balancing an irreplaceable heirloom on her fingertips. That comparison might not be too far off. Closing her lips, she swallows."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.IsThisFine": "[pg][say:Is this... fine?] she asks in a small voice, and you assure her it is. You realize she's visibly trying not to quiver. Another swallow, another tentative step, and then she all but barrels into you, sweeping you [if (tallness < 53) {up }]into a crushing, three-armed embrace, the fourth holding the plant aloft and out of immediate harm's way."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.MaybeWater": "[pg][say:...The water, mayhap?] the girl speculates in a murmur. Glasses back on her nose, she straightens up and throws a peek into the temple. [say:It does possess some... unusual properties. Yet still, this...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.RemarkableWhisper": "[pg][say:That is...] Marielle whispers besides you, looking on in awe, [say:remarkable.] You've never seen a regular, non-corrupted plant grow so quickly before, you comment. [say:Well, uhm, 'tis not... supposed to. Not quite like so.] She takes off her old-fashioned spectacles, tasking one set of hands with cleaning them while she leans forwards. You don't note anything weird with it when she lifts the flower up on one branch, and apparently, neither does she."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.RightKindOfPlant": "[pg]You ask if it's really the right kind of plant."
  "Scenes.Marielle.GiveRose.WaterCries": "[pg][say:Water!] she cries all of a sudden, surfacing from you. In a whirlwind, she [if (tallness < 53) {sets you down|unclasps herself}], spins around, and strides towards a collection of boxes. [say:Where left I it... Ah!] Rummaging through a heavy chest yields her a wooden dish bowl which she hurries into the temple to fill up with puddle-water. She's practically brimming with glee when she returns and places it onto her desk together with the dried desert rose, letting the latter float and soak. You decide to join the seamstress at the edge in keenly watching the flower work its miracle."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Handholding.AhYetAgain": "[pg][say:Ah, yet again? Well...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Handholding.BrowRisesUp": "A single brow rises up as you [if (singleleg) {slide|take a step}] towards the undead girl, but she makes no move do anything more than that. Now standing close enough to touch her, you hold out your [hands], palms up, and ask for hers."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Handholding.GazesInQuestion": "[pg][say:Mine hands? Well, if you must...] Marielle gazes at you in question for a wink longer, then starts pulling and twisting at one of her wrists, its encircling stitches unravelling themselves."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.ButchersShopCleave": "[pg]It's like something right out of a butcher's shop: a fairly clean cleave--not entirely so, but no blood indeed. Even squeezing her hand doesn't draw any out. There's something moving within the flesh though, you note while you're curling a few of her fingers. Several small bones, as well. It's a rather morbid sight, but fascinating nonetheless."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.DoesThatPleaseYou": "[pg][say:Does that... please you?] Marielle eventually asks, in relative certainty referring to you kneading her soft flesh. You give her a positive answer."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.DontStopHer": "You don't stop her, and a series of rather unappetizing sounds follows until she has it entirely detached. After wiping it off with a cloth, she presents it to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.DubiousGlance": "[pg][say:Hmm... Very well,] she says, glancing at you dubiously, but [if (insultedfather) {expressing|having}] no qualms about then slowly twisting her hand out of its joint. Her other fingers help the circling stitches around the wrist to undo themselves, and you observe the flesh and sinews parting mostly on their own, only little coercive force needed. A quick wipe with a towel, and she presents you the detached thing."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.IndeedConfirm": "[pg][say:Indeed,] she is [if (insultedfather) {a little hesitant|quick}] to confirm. [say:'Tis one facet of what, ah, animates me whole; an arcane assurance that I...] She silently snaps a finger. You could swear you just felt the hand in your grasp twitch with it, but your attention swerves back towards the girl as she continues. [saystart]An assurance that I shall incur no risk of perishment through suchlike, ah, detachments of limbs. If the spell be given time enough, 'twill allay any... pain and prevent, uhm... an unstaunched mishap."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.LackOfTerminology": "[pg][say:I am afeard I am in lack of the proper, ah... terminology,] Marielle says to address your overt curiosity, [say:but 'tis much as a tall ship's rigging--a, ah, grand apparatus of ropes and spars and slings and swivels.] When you ask if you can touch the open flesh, she grimaces briefly, already foretelling her response before she says, [say:I would you do not.] Just looking it is, then. You wonder aloud why there is nothing dripping or seeping out--is that the work of magic?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.MoreShuffling": "[pg]More shuffling as [if (femininity >= 59) {she fiddles with her remaining fingertips|she glances to the side}]. Whatever her face tells you, the girl doesn't say any of it out loud, but instead opts for a quiet, inexpressive sniff, pushes her glasses a little higher, and holds herself still. It seems to work for her, as she does relax somewhat and weaves her gaze over the assorted miscellany atop her desk to distract herself, letting you silently do with her hand as you like."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.NothingNewRevealed": "[pg]Turning it about reveals nothing new you didn't spot before, so you simply make do with keeping her hand held in your grasp while more or less idly massaging its fingers. The seamstress shifts a little on her stool, eyeing you and your motions with rising dubiety underneath a[if (isfemale) { paper-thin}] mask of impassiveness."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.PrayBeMindful": "[pg][say:Pray be mindful, 'tis yet very much a part of mine.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.SayISee": "[pg][say:I see...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.ShufflingOnSeat": "[pg]As you keep turning it about, you notice Marielle shuffling slightly on her seat, her eyes tracking your movements. She's clutching the empty stump, and though she keeps it covered, there doesn't seem to be any blood. You check the other side of that wrist."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.StrangeSeveredHand": "[pg]You have to admit that it feels strange to be holding someone's severed hand; a sensation that is exacerbated by the knowledge that its owner is still alive--or something close to that--and could reattach it at will. As for itself, it's... a hand. Delicate, unmistakeably feminine, and nearly as cold as a corpse's, but little different from any other human's. The one thing setting it apart is the many stitched scars running over its ivory skin. They're more numerous here than on the rest of Marielle's body, as every single knuckle is sporting one, and the back of her hand is marred with a few more. The palm, however, has been spared that treatment."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.TisUnperfect": "[pg]Well, 'tis unperfect[sayend]--she motions to the blood-spotted cloth on the table--[say:but quite sufficient.] "
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingLet.WantedLookAtHand": "You wanted to have a look at her hand on its own, you clarify."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.BundlesFourHands": "[pg]She bundles all four of them together on her lap, looking in your general direction with a mildly pensive expression on her face."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.EachMomentWarms": "[pg]With each passing moment of physical intimacy, she seems to warm up more and more to you, literally and figuratively. Her hands she keeps slack and malleable while she shuffles to adjust her seat, yet even she can't entirely resist reacting to your touches. A ghosting fingertip on your [skinshort] is the first you feel of it. It's a little odd, tickling you enough to draw out an involuntary twitch, but then it hits you she's not just reciprocating your affections, but rather [i:replicating] them--as light and precise as an actual phantom."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.GrazeFingernails": "[pg]As you graze over them, your attention is momentarily drawn to her fingernails, so you turn one hand and hold it up for your inspection. They usually escape your notice, and this close, it becomes obvious why: she keeps them short, scrupulously neat, and unadorned. Far more unassuming than you would expect from an upper-class dressmaker. You ask her about it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.JustHoldHands": "You just want to hold hands, and you clarify that by reaching for Marielle's upper pair."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.LetMomentsPass": "[pg]You both let the moments pass in silence. Eventually, Marielle softly hems, and though it probably wasn't, you see that as a sign to gently let go of the hands you're clasping and vacate her intimate space again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.PoppingJointBack": "[pg][say:Oh,] she says, popping the joint back into place. [say:Ah, my apologies, then, I but mistook you.] She regards your two still-outstretched hands, then her own complement of four. With gingerly caution, her upper pair rises and lays itself into your palms."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.PreserveQuietude": "[pg]You both preserve the quietude of the old sanctum, however much of an added challenge that proves to be in your endeavor to draw slow shapes and signs over Marielle's hands, her own slim fingers running their mirror-course in turn. On a particularly sinuous stroke, a titter puffs out of her before she can stop it, though the girl still tries to conceal it behind a soft hem and a turned head. With her visage being washed in a passing tide of raspberry, she squeezes you, entreating you to make no comment and settle down into simple hand-holding, which you do then enjoy just as gladly for the contact alone."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.RatherCold": "[pg]They're rather cold, lacking much of the warmth of a living human, but it's not the lifeless, sapping chill of metal or stone; when you close your fingers over hers and start to gently rub them, they do acclimate to your temperature. The next thing you note is just how delicate and thin they really are. You can feel out every stitch, sinew, muscle, bone, and joint with surgical precision on your way down to the girl's wrists, where you clasp and hold them together."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.SaysNothingCircle": "[pg]Marielle says nothing, [if (femininity >= 59) {though her face and flitting eyes speak for themselves|and her face remains soft yet neutral}] as you circle your thumbs over her palms. You're satisfied staying like this, leaning against the table to make yourself a little more comfortable in your quest to explore and massage her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.StopSeamstress": "You stop the undead seamstress; this isn't what you had in mind, you just wanted to hold hands."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.TakesHerTime": "[pg]The seamstress takes her time, letting her gaze glide over your own [hands] before answering, [say:'Tis most befit the tailor's office. And one's comfort. One needs not fret on such things as, ah, harming one's thread nor fabric nor nails, nor scotching someone in a moment of... inadvertency.] {0} [say:Lief tread I on precaution's side.] Sounds reasonable enough. You examine the hands in your grasp for a few moments longer before giving them both a final warming rub-down and relinquishing them back to Marielle's control."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.VeryWellSays": "[pg][say:[if (femininity >= 59) {...}]Very well,] is all she says, letting you proceed."
  "Scenes.Marielle.HandholdingStop.WillingToComply": "[pg]She seems willing to comply with your whims, keeping the hands in your grasp slack and malleable for you to turn or curl in any way you wish. For a while, that's exactly what you do, making use of her slim fingers' flexibility while you run your own over and between until you finally settle down on simple hand-holding."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.AsksWhenLiftOff": "[pg][say:[name]?] she asks when you lift off the hat. A few lone strings cling to its material, but you carefully untangle them and set it down onto the table. The light now shines right into her face, making the sensitive girl wince and shift to the side a little. She then tenses as your palm cups the top of her head mid-motion, though otherwise doesn't seem[if (insultedfather) { too}] disturbed by your action, instead holding still as you gently start to stroke her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.DiffidentResponse": "[pg][say:Well, you... you may, if it please you.] A diffident response, but that's more than enough for you. Marielle straightens her back, not moving another inch when you place your hand on her head; only her eyes peek up to follow your motions as far as they can."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.DontDisturbPeace": "[pg]You don't want to disturb the peace with words, so you continue petting her without speaking a word, equally toying with and caressing the lengthy, light-blonde strands. It's almost like playing with a doll, though this one is life-sized[if (insultedfather) { and breathing|, breathing, and leaning minutely into your every stroke}]. It's... delightful, you note with mounting joy, a soothing sense of comfort spreading its warm tendrils within you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.EffortToPlease": "[pg]In an effort to make it as pleasant as you can for her, you let your fingertips trace over her scalp, savoring the smoothness of her hair as you rake it downwards before beginning up top again, repeating the soothing process over and over until her eyelids decide to close at last.[if (!insultedfather) { Almost imperceptibly, she then leans into your touch.}] Continuing that motion with one hand, you run the other in slow, sporadic figures over her tresses of velvet, interspersing the occasional soft pat and tousling them in the process, though the quiet seamstress makes no protest to your ruffling of her hair. Indeed, she seems to [if (insultedfather) {start to somewhat|quite}] enjoy it, if you're interpreting the faint curvature of her lips correctly while a silent sigh slips out of them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.FallsSilentPosture": "[pg]Marielle falls silent after that. But her posture--all hands folded on her lap, eyes not knowing where to rest and blinking more often than necessary--is not a reluctant one. She appears confused, if anything."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.HatHangingOff": "Her hat's hanging off to the side, obscuring her longsword's hilt from cursory glances, which thus leaves the softness that is her long, light-blonde hair fully unobstructed; it flows down her body, just begging you to touch it, and almost unconsciously, you draw closer until you're standing directly before Marielle, one arm half-outstretched towards her. She peers at you quizzically."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.KnucklesAcrossHead": "[pg][say:[name]?] she asks as you lightly brush your knuckles across the top of her head before you cup it with your palm, making the girl tense up. Though other than that, she doesn't seem[if (insultedfather) { too}] disturbed by your action, holding still as you gently start to stroke her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.LongCirclesScalp": "[pg]Starting out in long circles over the girl's scalp, you marvel at how magnificently silky her hair feels to the touch, rendering you unable to resist sinking your fingers right into it and raking them down the flowing cascade of gold. Not a single knot impairs its velvety flow--she really must be taking meticulous care of it, you think to yourself as you leisurely keep combing with one hand, the other rising up again to stroke her head. Her own hands are stacked atop each other on her lap, unsure of what to do, but she's got her eyelids closed now in a display of tranquillity."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.LongStraightTresses": "Those long, straight tresses of hers capture your interest once more, tempting you with their excellently maintained smoothness and luxurious lustre in {0}. You want to pet the undead girl again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.MixInPats": "[pg]Little by little, you mix in a few pats, a bit of light-hearted fondling over and behind her ears to draw the faintest reactions from the demure girl before you then brush across in a wide sweeping motion, gathering her hair only to once again smooth it down into its natural state of near-perfect straightness. It's easy to become lost in petting the seamstress's tresses--your palms and fingers are beginning to positively tingle as you stroke and ruffle, stroke and ruffle without cease until you at last feel satisfied enough to slowly stop tousling Marielle. A few caresses, a finishing pat on the head, and you let go of her and [if (singleleg) {slide|step}] back to admire your work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.PutOnHerHat": "She's put on her hat, trying to fend off a stray ray of light that is peeking through a crack in the domed ceiling above and hitting the dense straw, but underneath, the light blonde of her hair flows down her body, seeming so soft, just begging to be touched. Almost unconsciously, you draw closer until you're standing directly before Marielle, arm half-outstretched towards her. She peers at you quizzically. Might as well go for it, now."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.SayIsItSo": "[pg][say:Is't so...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.UhmSheAsksAgain": "[pg][say:[if (femininity >= 59) {U-}]Uhm, [name]?] she asks again. [say:What are you... doing?] Your hand wanders a little lower, drawing circles through the silken hair as it goes. You think it's pretty clear that you're petting her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.UhmUttersShe": "[pg][say:Uhm...] utters she when you put your request into words, your fingers already preparing their advance. There is clearly something going through her mind, but she doesn't voice it, straying elsewhere before she snaps back{0} and beckons you closer, a motion so slight you nearly miss it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Headpat.WispsOutOfPlace": "[pg]There are some wisps clearly not where they belong, but overall, she's tidy enough. Her eyes though--lidded and directed groundwards--show no discernible expression, nor are they staring at anything in particular, making you wonder to what mental shores your petting has ferried the girl."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Insulted.AughtYouSeek": "[pg][say:Be there aught you seek?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Insulted.GreetsWithName": "[pg][say:[name],] is all she greets you with. There's no anger in her voice or eyes, and she looks overall as calm and composed as usual, but she doesn't try to hide the frown that mars her features while she regards you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Insulted.LooksUpSighing": "The seamstress looks up as you approach, and you can see her silently sighing to herself before she sets down her tools and folds all four hands on the table."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedAgain.BringUpFatherAgain": "You promptly bring up her father again and, without pulling any punches whatsoever, proceed to tell the undead girl what you think of him and necromancers in general. As you thoroughly insult her to her face, Marielle simply sits there, silently taking it all while holding your stare and not moving a single muscle. Aside from the occasional reflex to blink, her expression remains unchanging. Only after you finish does she glance to the side, towards her Anastatica, and you notice her posture sink a little."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedAgain.RestrainedFarewell": "[pg][say:...If that be all thou wished to say, I bid thee farewell, [name].] Audibly restrained, but far from the furious outburst you got the first time--now, there's only a certain weariness to her voice."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.AnotherSighAgree": "[pg][say:But your{0}; loathe would I be to, ah, cast away it all for a few words uttered in overmuch hotness.] Another sigh. You can only agree with that sentiment, but for some reason, she now looks gloomier than she did before, her fingers listlessly drumming the desk while she stares at a particular, or perhaps no particular, spot on it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.BesmirchApologyLies": "[pg][say:Pray think me no fool, [name], and besmirch not your apology with lies well-meant. Howsoever dreadful, you spoke naught in vain, and neither did I... but...] She plays her fingertips over the dark wood of her table."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.BreaksSilenceName": "[pg][say:Hmm... [name]?] Marielle eventually says, breaking the silence again. [say:May I... have some time unto myself?] She doesn't sound mad, but the answer she's given so far hasn't been entirely decisive, so you ask if the two of you will be fine again. The girl stays quiet once more for a worryingly long time before replying."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.BrowRisesApology": "One of Marielle's brows briefly rises when you start to apologize, but after only the first sentence, she cuts you off."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.BrowsRiseSilent": "Marielle's brows briefly rise when you start to apologize, but she remains entirely silent all throughout, and also for quite a while after you've finished. Her expression is a difficult one to gauge--seemingly unchanged from before, but something underneath it is different, brooding, almost melancholic. You wonder if you should say anything more or perhaps give her some space."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.DidntMeanIt": "[pg]You try to tell her you didn't mean it like that, but the girl quickly interrupts you with a raised hand."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.GlanceAnastatica": "[pg][say:Well,] she says, pausing for a second to glance at the Anastatica you gave her, [say:if your words be in sincerity, I shall accept them. Father and I may be... revolting, abominable monstrosities to you, but--]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.LeaveHerToSelf": "[pg]With that, you leave her to herself, exiting the tranquil shrine and entering the humid, fetid quagmire beyond to make your way back to your campsite. All in all, that seemed to have patched it up decently, though you doubt she'll ever just forget your insults."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.SummonsSmallSmile": "[pg][say:A good day to you, and...] She summons up a small smile that doesn't really reach any further than the corners of her mouth. [say:Thank you.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.TakeHerByWord": "[pg]You take her by her word, then, and bid Marielle farewell."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.TensionPoursOut": "[pg]Then, what you realize was sheer tension pours out of her with a heavy sigh."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.WantsToBeAlone": "[pg][say:...Yes. Yes, all shall be well betwixt us, [name], but I would like to be alone awhile.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedApologize.WordsNaughtButLies": "[pg][say:Pray waste not one breath more, [name]. We both know your words to be naught but vacuous wisps, pregnant only unto themselves,] she says, shutting down any further attempts at reconciliation. [say:Now, I bid you leave this abhorred abomination to herself, for she has yet many a thing to do.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedCommission.InquireCommission": "You inquire about your commission--back then, Marielle said she would be done by now, but you don't know if that promise still holds."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedCommission.ReachesIntoBox": "[pg][say:Of course.] She swiftly reaches into a box to the side and pulls out the piece you requested, handing it over to you without fanfare or further words. It's neatly folded, and exactly the fine artisanship you paid her for."
  "Scenes.Marielle.InsultedLeave.CurtlyNods": "She only curtly nods as you [if (singleleg) {slide|step}] back before distracting herself from your presence with work again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.BeginsTrailsOff": "[pg][say:I...] she begins, but trails off at once."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.DoesntReciprocate": "[pg]Curiously, the seamstress doesn't immediately reciprocate it, and although her arms do stop what they're doing and set down their tools, she doesn't meet your face. You ask if something is wrong."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.EyesHopSideways": "[pg][say:No. No, I, ah... Well, such... activity]--her eyes hop sideways and back--[say:may oft leave one forspent and... slumberous, yet for me to swoon, to be so throughly reft of watch and ward is... 'tis rather seldom. Not quite am I so frail as may I appear.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.GoodDayToYou": "[pg][say:I, ah... I mean... I mean, a good day to you too, [name].] As she finally turns to you, you notice how strangely broody she looks: her lips are pressed thin, and her hands still fiddle with the scissors and needles they just relinquished."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.GoodMorrowWelcome": "[pg][say:Ah, a good [if (hour < 12) {{morrow|[if (hour < 15) {{day|[if (hour < 18) {{afternoon|even}}]}}]}}] to you, [name],] Marielle says in welcome, {0} as she sets down scissors and needles to shift her attention to you instead."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.GreetWorkingSeamstress": "You approach the working seamstress and greet her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.HalfStrainedThanks": "[pg][say:Well, like enough came you not hither to but hear half-strained thanksgivings. What might I do for you?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.InterestPiqued": "[pg]Though now your interest is piqued, so you ask her if that's a common occurrence. She shuffles around, putting her hands onto her lap to hold them still before answering."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.MustApologize": "[pg][say:I... believe I must apologize to you, for... for what, ah, erewhile befell me.] Her passing out after you worked her perhaps a little too avidly, you muse. [say:Y-Yes, 'tis that indeed...] The sudden burst of cinnabar across her cheeks tells you she certainly remembers it. Well, you [if (corruption < 25) {are largely to blame for what happened--you should have realized she wasn't in the greatest condition and stopped in time.|aren't entirely innocent here--the signs were there, you just didn't listen.}] Marielle stays quiet, apparently not too keen on talking any more about this, despite being the one who brought it up."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.PlaceholderParagraph": "[pg]{0}"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.SilenceSettles": "[pg]Once more, silence settles into the old temple. You wonder just how you should continue this conversation, if at all. But Marielle speaks up again, a hint of a smile emerging on her face."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.SwirlingGesture": "[pg][say:And, uhm, I wished to thank you withal, for your, ah... assistance whiles I was... well...] Her swirling hand gesture is one you're not completely sure how to interpret. [say:So... thank you, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.ThrowGreeting": "You approach Marielle and throw a greeting towards her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.WantedToSayOut": "[pg]With what she wanted to say now out of the way, Marielle makes the slight shift back into her usual merchant-manner, pushing up her glasses while regarding you with a warm expression that's trying its hardest to not still look morbidly embarrassed."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Intro.WhatMayIDo": "[pg][say:So, what may I do for you?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.CarriedOnWaves": "[pg]You are being carried on gentle waves, the ocean around you soothing and untroubled. There is nothing else in sight, only the sparkling blue expanse of conjoined sea and sky. It feels like heaven."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.CryOverheadBird": "[pg]A {0} cry overhead. You blink into the sun as the bird zips past and spirals upwards, drawing wide circles above you. [if (corruption < 50) {{What a shame|Pesky creature}}]--you're resting here, can't you have this small break?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.EllipsisFragment": "[pg][say:...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.EllipsisName": "[pg][say:...[name].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.EyelidsGrowHeavy": "[pg]Your eyelids grow heavy. Too heavy to keep open, and why would you?[if (corruption > 70) { Something in the back of your subconscious is trying to tell you why, but you ignore that insignificant voice.}] With a sigh, you tilt your head back and let serenity take you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.FellAsleep": "[pg][say:You, ah... fell asleep.] It seems you did. [say:My apologies, but you... were nighly slipping,] Marielle says, seeming {0} having to wake you up. It's probably preferable if she does it rather than a lungful of water, and you do think it's about time for you to get out anyway, judging by the state of your wrinkled fingertips."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.FineWithThat": "And you're fine with keeping it that way."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.FloorQuiteFine": "[pg][say:Ah. Hmm... Upon the floor shall be quite fine, a little dust and dirt will be no matter,] Marielle assures you. She's still in the pool, eyeing you, her head propped up on her many arms outside the water. [say:Well... adieu, [name]. A pleasant journey, I bid you.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.KnowsYourName": "[pg]And how does it know your name? You feel your mind being pulled away; the scenery around you changes, darkens, solidifies."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.LazilyScrubbing": "[pg]Lazily scrubbing the dirt off your [skinfurscales], you enjoy this quiet, peaceful atmosphere and the simple company of the undead seamstress. As you keep idly rubbing and kneading, your weary muscles relax, all tension and stress melting into the warm water, flowing from you in thick streams and vanishing into this calming, cleansing pool. Feeling much cleaner already, you lean against the stone and let your mind and body drift."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.LeavingIAssume": "[pg][say:You are, ah, leaving, I assume?] she asks. Barely even a question, but you answer it regardless as you pull yourself up onto the edge and grab the towel the girl gave you earlier. It's soft. Splendidly soft. She probably made that herself. It smells nice, too. Soon, you're dry enough to [if (!isnaked) {put your [armor] back on|not freeze on your way back}] and, standing with the towel in hand, you ask the seamstress where you can leave it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.NameQuestion": "[pg][say:[name]?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.NoBirdJustHer": "[pg]No bird. Just Marielle, leaning carefully over you, one hand hovering above your shoulder, another arm protecting her modesty, and a look of concern on her young face. She {0} backwards when you stir, {1} as you rise and stretch."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.NotConversational": "[pg]Marielle herself isn't exactly someone to initiate a conversation, nor does she make much of any noise at all, and so with both of you quietly content, you spend your bath in silence. As you relax and listen to the sounds of the marshland life outside, time quickly starts to fly by, a fact you only become aware of when you languorously raise your hand out of the water and glance at it after what shouldn't have been more than just a few minutes--though clearly, it was. You think you'd better be getting out sooner rather than later."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.PoolSerenity": "[pg]The inviting serenity of this pool does make you feel a little sleepy, but you're not quite tired enough to do anything more than rest for a bit."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.ReciprocateFarewell": "[pg]You reciprocate the farewell, leave her be, and exit the temple, a fresh spring in your step. The trek back feels lighter somehow, almost as if you're still floating in the soothing water of that pond."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.SayEllipsis": "[pg][say:...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustBathe.SearchingForDrive": "[pg]While searching for the drive to move your unwilling[if (isgoo) { and unsubstantial}] bones again, you look over to the girl who's in here with you. Her eyes are closed, but snap open as soon as you finally stir, following you [if (isfemale) {with perhaps more than just attention|briefly}]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.BreakKissBreathe": "You break the kiss, just to catch your breath and get a look at Marielle's flushed expression."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.DepartFromLips": "[pg]Still, eventually, you do depart from the seamstress's warmed-up lips and overcome the impulse to dive right back in. It'd probably be best to grant [if (libido >= 70) {her|both of you}] a much-needed break."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.FailsToVocalize": "[pg][say:I... You are...] Marielle starts and fails to vocalize her thoughts, struggling to regain her breath and find the right words. You stroke her cheek and give her a parting peck before untangling yourself and easing back, a pleasant warmth now blooming in your chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.LiddedSteelEyes": "[pg]Her steel-blue eyes--lidded and unfocused behind her glasses--don't seem to be looking as much [i:at] as [i:through] you, and a few strands of hair have fallen haphazardly over them. When you reach out to brush them away, you {0}."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.PagePlaceholderPeriod": "[pg]{0}."
  "Scenes.Marielle.JustKiss.SweetSourness": "[pg]The deathless girl's oddly sweet sourness greets you when your [tongue] meets her own, and the many arms around you deepen the embrace further, thoroughly entangling you in her grasp. Not that you would want to escape. You push her back to the table, only vaguely conscious of its hard wooden edge, though you don't think she minds, at this point. The eagerness with which she clings to you is electrifying, igniting; even her near-lifelessly cold flesh feels hot against yours, and her little interspersed moans and gasps coupled with the lustful forays in between and the many hands mapping the contours of your body render you unwilling to ever even let go of her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.AdvancingKisses": "[pg]Under the accompaniment of advancing kisses and a mild, spruce-like fragrance, you ease your hand towards the back of her head, where it's soon mirrored by one of hers as you smooth down and rake through her long, luxuriously silken hair, her remaining trio finding other parts of your body to cross and stroke while you let yourself be reeled in. Two in particular seem quite fond of your [hips], tantalizing you with their ever-bolder motions that seize more and more of your butt, yet never quite commit to groping you in earnest. With frisky reciprocation, you dip your fingertips down over her side's soft meat to tickle a stifled squeak out of the slender seamstress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.AsideFromGulps": "[pg]But aside from that and the occasional gulped breath, there's no need to dedicate your mouths to anything but a wordless, dancing play of lips, and before long, you've ended up practically sitting on Marielle's lap, your [if (biggesttitsize > 4) {chest squashed against her own)|[if (isflat) {flat chests conjoined|chest comfortably resting against her own}]}]. With your arms slung around each other, you delight yourselves in teasing pecks, questing touches, and roving fingers."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.BlinksAndStirs": "[pg]Finally, Marielle blinks and stirs, and the very next moment, you feel a pair of hands pressing against your chest. And it's not the good kind. It's the kind that's telling you to stop. With an inward sigh, you resign yourself to comply and pull away to give the seamstress the space she obviously needs to sort her thoughts. She doesn't seem upset, at least."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.CantLetYouKiss": "[pg]She can't let you kiss her{0}? You wonder why she's still gone further with you than that, then."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.CaughtByLips": "Caught by those young, pale lips of hers, there's only one thing that comes to your mind{0}. With a confident saunter, you skirt the table occupied by cloths and sewing tools before leaning in with obvious intent."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.ClaimsNotAttracted": "[pg]For someone who claims to not be attracted, she does at times seem awfully tense and bashful around you, though. You point that out to her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.CloseSeePalm": "[pg][if (femininity >= 59) {Suddenly, you feel a palm pushed flat against your chest. Light, yet firm in meaning. You stop, a hair's breadth away from her cold, thinly pressed lips.|Before you can reach her however, she suddenly jerks her head away and out of your grasp; the palm now pressing firmly against your chest tells you all the rest you need to know. You stop, a hair's breadth away from her face.}] This close, you can see what runs through Marielle's steel-blue eyes: a small, localized turmoil of worries and consternations. But her hand doesn't waver. Sighing into yourself, you back up and give her space, allowing the distressed seamstress to relax somewhat as you pull away from her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.ColdGivePause": "[pg]They're cold, giving you pause for just a split-second despite having been prepared. She freezes up, eyes wide, and that's when you find yourself again and press on, press closer, careful not to knock her glasses off."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.ColorRises": "[pg]As you close in, some color rises to the girl's ivory features. [say:[name]?] she asks hesitantly. [say:Wherefore [if (silly) {art thou|are you}]--] You don't let her finish that. Cupping her cheek, you join her lips to yours."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.DoubtCallingUgly": "[pg]You doubt she's calling you outright ugly here, and since Marielle has disclosed her preference for women and femininity in general before, it shouldn't come as much of a surprise that she's rejecting you. Right now, she appears rather troubled though, watching you with what might be worry, but when you voice your acknowledgement, it seems to assuage her enough to shift that expression to relief. A brief but grateful nod then puts a lid on this whole exchange."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.EyesAverted": "[pg][say:I have told you, have I not?] Although her eyes remain averted, she doesn't sound mad or annoyed. [say:Not with affection's finest, faintest, nor stoutest net may men entrammel mine heart and, ah, hale it ashore, for forcast have I their waters, head to fin. Nor would I them thus entangle, were it invert. And, uhm, by its very draft, kissing... well... begs so twinly becaught an inwardness. Overmuch so.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.EyesWidenRealization": "[pg]Her eyes widen in realization, her breath catches. Your chance. You gently cup her chin, open your mouth ever so slightly, move closer--"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.FallsSilent": "[pg]With that, she falls silent. She didn't entirely answer your question, but you figure there is no point in trying to push the issue any further."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.FidgetsApology": "[pg][say:I... I...] She fidgets, failing to meet your gaze. [say:My... deepest apologies, [name]. But that I cannot do,] she says in a tone somewhere between averse and apologetic."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.FirstAttempts": "[pg][say:I, uhm... Pray...] are her first attempts, but they go nowhere as she wipes her lips with her forefinger's knuckles before gazing down at that wetted digit. It takes her a good while to speak up once more."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.FrowningGirlFreezes": "[pg]The questioningly frowning girl all but freezes up when you brush some hair away from her pale cheek and join your lips to hers. There's no reaction. Just a cold, closed mouth and two wide eyes of greyish, piercing sapphire that stare at--or rather [i:into]--you like they're failing to comprehend the world while you try to deepen this one-sided kiss by drawing her into an embrace."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.IntoningNoMan": "[pg][say:I am aware you are no... man,] she says, intoning that last word more as a tentative query than a statement, [say:and I pray you will have my apologies, but, ah... well... Yet can I not answer suchlike... tenders of affection, be they made unto me by a mien and countenance as yours, [name]. 'Tis without the demesne of adaptness.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.MyApologiesContemn": "[pg][say:My apologies... I sought not to contemn you, that was much malapert and uncouth of me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.NoMoveToResist": "[pg]Marielle makes no move to resist you, so you let your hand wander to the back of her head, fingers raking through her light golden hair as you pull yourself in while gradually, she starts to [if (femininity >= 59) {relax|thaw}] in your grasp. You feel two arms wrap around your back, one on your shoulder, a fourth on your hip, reeling you further in until your [if (biggesttitsize > 3) {chest comfortably rests against hers|[if (isflat) {flat chests touch|chest presses against hers}]}] as you practically come to sit on the girl's lap. Before long, you've lost yourselves in each other's embrace, teasing pecks and roving fingers being all the language you need to communicate right now."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.RealizesWhatYouWant": "[pg]She seems to realize what it is you're out for as you close in--a hint of shyness rises up, but all it takes is to cup her cheek, and she tilts her head ever so slightly, allowing you to play your thumb across her lips for a few suspended heartbeats until you join them to yours. [if (femininity >= 59) {Quickly|Gradually}], the girl all but dissolves in your affection."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.StartsQuiteAware": "[pg][say:I...] Marielle starts. [say:I am[if (femininity >= 59) { quite}] aware.] A sigh. [say:Yet these are the instants whereon 'tis all I think of, this 'extra' of yours, as you it coin... and it, ah, well... it appals me.] Her arms shoot up when she realizes how harshly that came across. [say:I am-- I mean--] The girl abruptly stops and lowers her head and voice, letting her hands drop onto her lap, where they grasp her dress's fabric."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.VoiceEbbs": "[pg][say:I--] Her voice rises, though it ebbs away just as quickly, and she folds her arms in defence, accompanied by an exhale. [say:...'Tis of a different nature, [name].] The tent then stays quiet as she chooses her next words."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.VoiceRises": "[pg][say:I-- That is--!] Her voice rises along with her head. [say:That is... different,] she finishes in a softer tone. [say:'Tis different.] She folds her arms defensively and exhales, but then stays quiet for a long time."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.VoiceShootsUp": "[pg][say:'Tis--!] Once more, Marielle's voice shoots up, and she stops to release a frustrated sigh. You're not sure whether that's directed at you or herself. [say:'Tis naught I may bridle, [name]. Your visage bears so... fair and feminal a likeness, and yet are you not that which you appear.] She finally turns to look into your eyes, staring and frowning at you for a long moment before speaking. [say:You are... pleasing, that I cannot gainsay, but that is all it is... Pray think not I intend to bemock or deceive you.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.WhyNotTurnDown": "[pg]{0}You wonder why she wouldn't {1}turn you down entirely then, if she won't even kiss you{2}."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Kiss.YouAreAWoman": "[pg]But you [i:are] a [if (ischild) {{girl|woman}}]. Perhaps with a little extra{0}, but you are. You protest as much."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Leave.YouBackFromThe": "You head back to camp."
  "Scenes.Marielle.LewdBack.ConsiderWhatElse": "You consider what else to do."
  "Scenes.Marielle.LewdMenu.ObviouslyWaiting": "[pg]She's obviously waiting for you to do or say something, whatever that may be."
  "Scenes.Marielle.LewdMenu.RegardPaleGirl": "You regard the thin, pale-skinned girl, her attention and body turned towards you. Marielle's expression doesn't give away any particular emotion; her features are relaxed and friendly, lending her an air of what you could call professional affability, and her posture remains modest and ladylike."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Masturbate.ArtisanDexterity": "[pg]As Marielle displays her fine artisan's dexterity by gently rubbing your walls in ways that make you break the kiss for a pent-up moan, your hands find and loosen a few buttons at her gown's neckline, underneath a layer of ruffles, then come to rest on her shoulders. You massage some further encouragement into her while you hook underneath the flounced fabric in order to slide it downwards. Soft, snow-white skin is slowly revealed by the descending cloth. You lean in and let your lips follow behind until you arrive at the girl's small chest, where you have only little time to tease a perking nipple and provoke an inhale that presents her ribcage in stark relief before a determined thrust reminds you of the fingers inside you. With that, she shifts into a counter-attack on your own [chest]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Masturbate.AwakenedArms": "[pg]Awakened from idleness, one set of arms[if (hasarmor) { deftly frees you from the top of your [armor][if (hasuppergarment) { and undoes your [uppergarment]}], then|[if (hasuppergarment) { deftly undoes your [uppergarment], then}]}] moves to caress and knead the [if (isnakedupper) {always|now}]-naked targets that are your [if (isflat) {flat breasts|[if (biggesttitsize < 5) {nice, soft tits|large, pliable jugs}]}]. Her touches are brief and frustratingly light, merely courting with the prospect of proper devotion, but nonetheless achieving the goal of straightening your spine in a shiver when she rolls your nipples through her fingertips. Just as you do, she pulls your body to hers, embracing you even tighter, and begins to fixate entirely on your [vagina]. There's nothing you're happier to do right now than rest your brow against hers, unwind, and submit yourself to the lesbian seamstress's marvellous, sensual fingering."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Masturbate.CalmDownWinded": "[pg]By the time you calm down, you're winded and dizzy. You can hear Marielle panting in similar desperation, her many arms having fallen slack across your back and the yarn bundles you've strewn about in your impulsive lovemaking. Sliding your fingers out of her doesn't seem to evoke any response, so you prop yourself up to check on her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.Masturbate.CantWaitLonger": "No, you don't think you can wait any longer."
