  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsam.IdlyStrokesHair": "[pg][say:Oh! Oh, no. Alas, no.] One hand idly rises to stroke the lock of hair that was about to fall in front of her face. [say:But fortune would have it I once bechanced upon one who did... and she was quite fain to allow me view her travel memoir and illustrations therein... 'Twas positively enlightening.] The reminiscing smile on her lips lasts only a moment longer before she flicks away her hair and shifts the topic back to the dress itself."
