  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamFootrubYes.BuyThatDress": "You'll buy that dress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamFootrubYes.FitQuiteAgreeably": "[pg][say:Well, that shall fit you quite agreeably. Though hesitate not to ask, should aught else be required.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamFootrubYes.HeadTurnsAgree": "[pg][say:Hmm?] Her head turns to you. [say:Oh! Yes, of course, of course,] she cheerily exclaims. [say:I will but needs take your measurements; pray hold, ah, still.] She whips out two measuring tapes and quickly notes down your sizes, then strips out of the dress, into her usual one, and gets to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamFootrubYes.QuickFinishBeckons": "[pg]Quick to finish, she soon beckons you over to hand you the custom-tailored dress in exchange for the appropriate amount of gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModel.BuyingDressQuestion": "[pg]Are you buying the dress?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModel.HesitatesIllBefit": "[say:I am]--the girl hesitates when you hold the garment out to her--[say:rather ill-befitted for such, ah, strange and seasoned gowns... yet if your wish be truly I demonstrate this upon mine so unripened body...] [if (femininity >= 59) {Her pale face suddenly reddens, and she refrains from saying anything further than that as she|She frowns at you, but nonetheless}] takes the dress from your hands and swivels around to change."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModel.LooseThinFrame": "[pg]Despite her efforts, it's still a little loose on her thin frame, and you don't think the skirt's hem is supposed to be actually grazing the ground, but the body-hugging style does make even someone like Marielle look almost curvaceous. Elegant it is, the embroidered patterns accentuating just the right places, and through the slits on the side, you can see the pale white of her legs peeking through in a surprisingly enticing fashion. She fidgets again as she notices where your gaze has wandered."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModel.SwiftGlimpseBack": "[pg]She's swift to do so, giving you only a passing glimpse of her back before slipping into the dress, setting her many arms to pull the fabric taut where needed, and finally turning to face you. Though there, under your scrutinizing gaze, she shuffles in unease."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModel.WellPrompt": "[pg][say:...[if (femininity >= 59) {W-}]Well?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelNo.ChangesBackCollection": "[pg]While she changes back into her usual dress, you take another look at her collection."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelNo.SlightFrownTell": "[say:Oh. Well, that is... Pray tell if there be aught else you would like,] Marielle says with a slight frown, though she quickly banishes it from her face."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelYes.BeckonsTailored": "[pg]True to her word, she soon beckons your over again and presents you the tailored dress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelYes.DipsCurtsy": "[pg][say:Ah, uhm, certainly.] Marielle dips into a small curtsy before taking the gems you offer her. [say:I will, ah, needs make some adjustments, though.] She grabs a pair of measuring tapes from the table and swiftly takes your sizes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelYes.NotOverlongWarrant": "[pg][say:Hmm, this shall take a while... but not overlong, I warrant.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelYes.TakesThisOne": "You'll take this one."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamModelYes.UncomfortableTell": "[pg][say:Well, that should be all. If it be, ah, uncomfortable anywhere, pray tell me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamNo.FoldsSilkenDress": "You fold the silken dress and put it back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamYes.AllDoneAmiss": "[pg][say:All should be done. Howbeit, pray tell me if aught be amiss therewith.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamYes.GrabsTapesMeasure": "[pg][say:Ah! Yes, just... hold still awhile, I need take your, ah, measurements first.] She grabs two long tapes from her desk and quickly notes down your sizes with them before taking the dress and sitting down to work on it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamYes.HandsMoneyDress": "You hand Marielle the money."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamYes.NotOverlongMinute": "[pg][say:Ah, it shall be not overlong. A minute, mayhap.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCheongsamYes.SlightlyLonger": "[pg]It turns out to be a little longer, but not by too much. She soon waves you back over, the tailored dress in her arms and a smile on her face."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloak.AskOneFiftyGems": "[pg]150 gems is what I ask of you, wish you to buy it.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloak.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloak.FashionedForMyself": "[pg][say:One I once fashioned for myself,] Marielle explains, sizing it up with a look of dissatisfaction, [say:in quest of aught to enshroud myself with, to ward off rays and eyes unwanted. Alas, 'twas a little too, ah... caliginous. Undead may I be, yet by evidence not befitted for such sable garments with]--she reaches down and pops up its neck piece--[say:upstanding collars.] She may be right; she doesn't look like a lady of the night who[if (ischild) {'s out to suck your blood| sucks the blood of little children}]. An amused smile crosses her lips."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloak.LargeBlackFabric": "Carefully, you take out a large sheet of black fabric and hold it out in front of you. A cloak, it appears. Rather plain and without any embellishments, but still lustrous and soft to the touch, evidently made of high-quality fabric despite its simplicity."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloak.ResilientAndStaunch": "[pg][say:Well, be I what I be may, 'tis quite resilient and staunch, although can I not advise taking it in lieu of armor true, for 'tis solely meant to complement,] she says, folding her hands together. [saystart]Ah, but, well, you may don it howsoever you wish, of course, that is entirely for you to choose."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloakNo.FoldCloakBack": "You fold the cloak and put it back into the box."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloakYes.HandMarielleGems": "You hand Marielle the gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCloakYes.LooksUpAndDown": "[pg][say:Ah, certainly. I am glad to see it find a new and--I hope--better owner in you, [name].] She looks you up and down, likely measuring you with her eyes. [say:Hmm, it should fit you quite fine, I ween. Although, of course, should I be mistaken, be not afeard to correct me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopClothes.LookThroughTrunk": "You look through the larger trunk."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopClothes.MostlyDressmaking": "[pg]It's pretty evident that her main field is dressmaking, as nearly all of the items here are exactly that: dresses. They're fairly high-class and, from what you can tell, well-made, and although there is a decent amount of variety among them, they're mostly garments you would expect behind the display windows of a fancy shop in a large, bustling city, not stuffed into a wooden box--however nice of a box it is--and carted through the swamp by a wandering vendor."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopClothesBack.ArrangeEverything": "You arrange everything as it was before."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.AskAboutCommissions": "Turning away from the two offered chests, you ask Marielle if she does commissions, too."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.EyesCurveDown": "[pg][say:But, well, uhm... if aught soever dance within your mind, prithee bid it sing, too, and...] Her eyes curve down over your gear. [say:A venturer, you are.] No question, but you confirm, which seems to brighten her idea's spark and lead her to say, [say:Well, should you, in the office of your cause, hap upon a thing you, ah... wis of note and workable, pray procure it hither, if you will. Mayhap a novelty may prove a muse be to me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.HaveDaughterCocoon": "[pg]You have your daughter's silken cocoon with you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.HaveNothingUsable": "[pg]You don't have anything on you that might interest her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.HaveSpiderSilk": "[pg]You have some spider silk in your bag."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.ShortPauseAboutTo": "[pg]A short pause, and you're about to bring up that she already has quite a bit of material here, but the seamstress decides to continue before you get a word out."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.UnfirmamentedFantasy": "[pg][say:Yet, the latter is the matter... Howsoever unfirmamented the fantasy may be that carves the fashion of a new gown, engyved are it and I by... what little this realm beteems us.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.WantCustomMade": "You'd like something made just for you. She does do commissions, so if you have any ideas or found something on your travels that could be worked into clothing, this seamstress here could be the one to ask."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopCommission.YesSlightSurprise": "[pg][say:Oh, why yes, of course,] she says with a slight note of surprise, [say:I do indeed. My services as a, ah, couturier are perchance of the kind quite most besought, for every soul would dight itself by its very inward fancy, given hope and scope.] That statement was doused in enthusiasm, though it doesn't last too long. A rap of her fingers follows, and she faintly purses her lips."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBra.CharmingIsItNot": "[pg][say:Charming, is it not?] Marielle asks rhetorically. [say:The purfles bear simpleness and innocence, and yet would they englamour many a, ah... lover.] She stops, seemingly lost in thought for a spell."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBra.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBra.FiftyGemsAsk": "[pg][say:Well, 50 gems is what I ask, should you wish to buy one.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBra.PullOutFrillyBra": "You pull out a particular bra that caught your eye. A fairly elegant, yet cute thing adorned with frills along the edges."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBraNo.PutFrillyBraBack": "You put the bra back into the collection of underwear."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBraYes.PinchAnywhereTell": "[pg][say:Should it pinch you anywhere, pray hesitate not to tell me. Any readjustments shall cost you naught, of course.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBraYes.TailoredBraMoment": "[pg]Little more than a moment later, she presents you the tailored bra."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyBraYes.WonderfulNeedsWork": "[say:Wonderful,] Marielle says as you hand her the money. [say:Though there shall be need of some, ah, alterations first, thus bid I you hold still, if you will...] She takes out a measuring tape and swiftly notes your chest and shoulder sizes. [say:'Twill be finished apace,] she says, sitting down at her desk again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPanties.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPanties.FiftyGemsPair": "[pg][say:50 gems are they, should you wish to purchase a pair.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPanties.ParticularPantiesCatch": "A particular pair of panties catches your eye, and you pull them out. A fairly elegant piece, adorned with frills at the edges, making them look quite pretty."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPanties.SomethingEndearing": "[pg][say:Something endearing, are they not?] Marielle asks as if reading your mind. [say:Innocent, yet enticing, though that may be by the, ah, eye of the beholder.] You don't really have anything to add to her assessment."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPantiesNo.PutFrillyPantiesBack": "You put the frilly panties back where they belong."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPantiesYes.AllIsDone": "[pg][say:All is done. Howbeit if they should be, ah, uncomfortable anywhere, pray tell.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPantiesYes.BeckonsFinishedPair": "[pg]After only a minute, she beckons you over to present you the finished pair of panties."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopFrillyPantiesYes.ClaspsManyHands": "[say:Oh, lovely,] Marielle says, clasping her many hands over the offered money. [say:Though I will needs make some, ah, adjustments. Pray keep... still.] She finds a tape and quickly takes the necessary measurements before getting to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimono.BuyKimonoQuestion": "[pg]Do you want to buy the kimono?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimono.FourHundredGems": "[pg][say:Hmm, should you be interested, then it may be yours for 400 gems.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimono.TakeOutRobes": "You take out a set of colorful robes that seem to belong together."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimono.TediousGarment": "[pg][say:Well, it may seem a tedious garment to don at first, but one erelong grows accustomed to its manifold layers. And once one does... well, 'tis quite warm and, ah... easeful.] The fabric does indeed feel incredibly soft to the touch."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimono.VestmentDelightsome": "[pg][say:Ah, yes, a vestment most delightsome,] Marielle says upon you holding them up for a more thorough examination of their silky length. [say:A 'kimono', should I be not mistaken entirely, or at least that is what the, ah, gentlewoman I have to thank for this design named it. Hmm...] She leans over to peer into the chest, then opens one of the drawers and pulls out a long, wide sash and a pair of other, thinner ones. [say:These will be needed withal, to girdle one's waist and hold fast the robes.] Those are quite a few pieces, you remark."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.BuyKimonoModelQuestion": "[pg]Do you want to buy it?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.ExpressionDeliberation": "Marielle's expression shifts briefly to one of deliberation before she reaches out to take the kimono from your arms."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.LacksMirror": "[pg]She doesn't really have one to begin with, but you'd expect even someone with a sizeable chest would have much of it concealed under all those layers. The dress in general covers a lot of skin and straightens the wearer's silhouette, though if you wanted, you could probably loosen it here and there to expose as much cleavage as you liked, shoulders included. Overall a very elegant, exotic garment that is sure to draw attention, no matter how exactly you decide to wear it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.LengthyProcess": "[pg][say:And, well, that is all.] A lengthy process. [say:Perchance. Yet fret you not; come some attempts, 'tis not so, ah, daunting any longer.] You keep that in mind and take some time to appraise her. Or rather, the kimono."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.SlipsHeavierPiece": "[pg]Next, the seamstress slips into the heavier, fancier piece and holds it up so as not to drag the earth, then folds it over just below chest height, tucks another belt under the excess fabric, and fastens it, slowing down for you to better follow. You note that she pulls the fabric over the belt until the garment no longer touches the ground without her support, then straightens the cloth out. That all seems a lot easier to do with four hands than with two, you reckon."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.SpreadsRobesDemo": "[pg][say:Well... I suppose if you, ah, desire a demonstration...] She spreads the robes out as she stands up, singles out the smaller one, then turns away and undresses in a remarkably swift motion. You only catch a moment of her unclothed backside before it's covered by the bathrobe-like underlayer. Tying it with a waistband, she swivels around again to better show off the rest of the dressing process."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.TwillRequirePractice": "[pg][say:Hmm... 'Twill require practice, certainly,] she says as she reaches for the wide sash and puts it over the fold she created, then wraps it around herself and binds the ends together. There's a lot of extra length left over, which she flips over a few times and fashions a large ribbon out of. Lastly, she slides the bow to face backwards, making her look somewhat like a birthday present. A little more straightening out and twisting her body to inspect herself, and she faces you again, fanning out her arms inside the robe's wide sleeves."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModel.WhatThinkYou": "[pg][say:What think you?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelNo.AsYouWill": "[say:Ah, hmm... as you will,] Marielle says when you tell her you aren't buying it, looking slightly let down for a short moment. [say:Well, should you change your mind, 'twould be my pleasure to assist you anew.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelNo.LookSelectionAgain": "[pg]While she re-dresses, you take a look at her selection again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelYes.FinishedKimono": "[pg]Not long after, she gets up from the table and holds the finished kimono out to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelYes.HopeBySatisfaction": "[pg][say:I hope this be by your satisfaction, [name], but pray tell if it should be not so.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelYes.NeedsAdjustments": "[pg][say:Wonderful! But, uhm, I must needs make a few adjustments for you,] she says as she pulls out two measuring tapes. You hold still while she notes down your sizes, murmuring to herself, then slips into her regular dress again and begins to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelYes.ThankAndPay": "[pg]You thank Marielle and hand her the gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoModelYes.ThinksWillTake": "You think you'll take it."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoNo.StowsKimono": "You stow the kimono and sashes back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.HandOverGems": "[pg]Nodding, you hand over the gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.RequiresMeasurements": "[pg][say:Oh, of course, but I will, ah... require some measurements to alter it for you. Just a moment, please...] Marielle takes out a couple of measuring tapes and starts eagerly taking in your sizes, murmuring to herself."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.RobesAllowVariation": "[pg][say:And that should be all. These robes allow for some, ah, variation, but pray tell should aught be amiss.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.TakeForPrice": "You'll take it for that price."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.TakesRobesMumbles": "[pg][say:Hmm, 'twill take a spell...] she mumbles, taking the robes from you and getting to work, adjusting her glasses before glancing up at you. [say:Ah, but not overlong.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopKimonoYes.TrueToWord": "[pg]True to her word, she gets up from her table after you have completed an idle round through the sanctuary and hands you the kimono with a smile on her face.[say:And that should be all. These robes allow for some, ah, variation, but pray tell should aught be amiss.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBra.IsIt": "[pg]Is it?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBra.PullOutLaceBra": "You pull out a meticulously patterned lace bra. It feels quite smooth to the touch, you find as you turn it about in your hands."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBra.SixtyGemsAsk": "[pg][say:60 gems is what I ask for, should it be by your liking.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBra.SumptuousIsIt": "[pg][say:Sumptuous, is it not?] Marielle asks, putting a word to what you had in mind. [say:Lace has long been a choice most excellent for brassieres both comfortable and, ah... alluring.] She struggles a bit to say that last word out loud. [say:And whiles some may call its braiding a, ah, moil in all its faces, I have in faith found it a something precious treacle.] You suppose she really makes these by hand, then."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraNo.PutBraBack": "You put the bra back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraYes.AdjustsGlasses": "[pg][say:This shall take not overlong,] she says as she adjusts her glasses and sits down, bra in hand."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraYes.HandOverGems": "You hand Marielle the gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraYes.LetHerAdjust": "[pg][say:Ah, yes, I need make a few adjustments, though. 'Twill do not to be unfitting.] You let her have her way as she grabs a tape and measures your chest and shoulders."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraYes.TailoredBraDone": "[pg][say:That should be all, then. Howbeit, sit it not well, pray tell me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLaceBraYes.TrueToWord": "[pg]True to her word, it doesn't. Not long after, she presents you the tailored bra."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePanties.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePanties.EyesYouGreedily": "[pg][say:Fashioning lace may be somedeal time-consuming,] Marielle says, eyeing you with an unreadable expression as you knead the fabric, [say:but well worth the labor, as you appear to... be untombing.] She's still watching your fingers, but finally blinks herself away from them. [say:'Tis quite comfortable indeed, if one use the right, ah, textiles, and rather charming to the eye.] These do seem like pretty nice panties."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePanties.PullOutLacePanties": "You pull out a pair of panties made of finely patterned lace and turn them around in your hands; they're pretty soft to the touch."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePanties.SixtyGemsPurchase": "[pg][say:60 gems is what I ask, seek you a purchase.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePantiesNo.PutPantiesBack": "You put the panties back where you found them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePantiesYes.BeckonsPantiesOver": "[pg]Not long after, she beckons you over again and presents you the tailored panties."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePantiesYes.ExclaimsTakesMoney": "[pg][say:Ah,] she exclaims, taking the money and grabbing a measuring tape, [say:I will needs make adjustments, first. Pray hold, ah... still.] She [if (isfemale) {somewhat nervously|quickly}] takes your relevant measurements, then gets to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePantiesYes.FishOutGems": "You fish out the gems she asked for."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLacePantiesYes.ShouldBeAll": "[pg][say:Well, that should be all. If aught sit awry, pray but tell.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDress.AdjustsPinceNez": "[pg][say:Hmm...] She adjusts her pince-nez and skims through a pile of notes. [say:For you, 600 gems. Rather would I sell it anon by a, uhm, discount quite affordable than see it suffer yet another score of winters in desuetude...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDress.BuyDressQuestion": "[pg]Do you want to buy the dress?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDress.MadeLongAgo": "[pg][say:Ah,] Marielle pipes up, [say:that is one I made quite a while agone. 'Tis rather difficult to find anyone that which, ah, produces these little sequins in these lands. And more difficult still to find the occasion that, ah, would justify donning such a gown.] You can't imagine balls being in fashion right now, at least not the festive kind. But still, it looks expensive, so you ask for the price."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDress.PullOutDress": "You pull out a long, flowing dress, decorated with plenty of shiny little discs."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.BuyingItQuestion": "[pg]Are you buying it?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.ConsidersSilently": "Marielle silently considers the dress as you hold it out to her before she just as silently takes it from your hands."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.ProlongedSilence": "[pg]Marielle regards you with prolonged silence and patience, waiting for you to say something."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.ReadyForBallroom": "[pg]Well, she looks ready for the ballroom now. It's quite form-fitting, even on her, but would drag the ground if the petite seamstress weren't holding the flowing skirt up with her lower pair of hands. Slowly twirling around, she gathers her hair to the front, so you can have a gander at the open-back design[if (femininity >= 59) {, though she's quick to hide it again as soon as she's completed her small round, fidgeting on the spot a little.| before it disappears from your view as she completes her small round.}] You notice those sequins are fairly silent when she moves, hardly ever distracting the ear from anything else on the few occasions they do strike each other, and all in all, it's elegant, eye-catching, yet not overly gaudy despite its glittering adornments."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.TakesAWhile": "[pg]It takes her a while to put it on, but the sounds coming from behind you don't give you much of an indication as to what exactly she's struggling with. A lot of rustling, some soft tinkling, and finally a satisfied [say:Hmm] that marks your cue to turn around again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModel.WantsPrivacy": "[pg][say:Well, uhm, would you...?] She motions for you to give her some privacy, so you do just that, getting only the briefest glimpse of naked skin as she swiftly undresses."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelNo.LeaveToRedress": "[pg]You leave her to re-dress while you take another look at her wares."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelNo.SeemsDisappointed": "[say:Ah.] Marielle seems a little disappointed at your decision not to buy the dress. [say:Very well... Well, 'tis the sole one that, ah, remains thereof, so pray tell should you ever wish to purchase it still.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelYes.AughtBeAmiss": "[pg][say:Well, I hope 'tis by your, ah, satisfaction, [name]. Though if aught be amiss, prithee tell.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelYes.MoreThanThat": "[pg]You're pretty sure it was more than that by the time she beckons you over again, though the tailored result looks like it'll fit you like a second skin and should be well-worth the small wait."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelYes.PleasureCurtsy": "[pg][say:Certainly, a pleasure,] Marielle says with a smile and a slight curtsy before grabbing a measuring tape from her desk. [say:I will but needs make a few adjustments, so pray hold still...] Having only two free hands seems to hamper her somewhat, but she regardless has the needed sizes soon noted down and sends you off with a, [say:'Twill be but a minute.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressModelYes.TellsBuying": "You tell her you're buying that dress as you fish for the necessary gems and hand them to her."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressNo.PutDressBack": "You put the patterned dress back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressYes.HandsMoney": "You hand Marielle the money."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressYes.HandsTailoredDress": "[pg][say:Well, that should be all,] Marielle says, handing you the tailored dress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressYes.MeasuresQuickly": "[pg]She measures you in quick motions while mumbling to herself, four arms moving efficiently to assess your sizes, before taking the dress from you and getting to work. After a while, she rises up from her seat, contently nodding."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopLongDressYes.TakeMeasurements": "[pg][say:Oh, wonderful, but... pray allow me to... take your measurements and adjust it for you,] she says while putting the gems aside and pulling out two tapes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaid.BuyOutfitQuestion": "[pg]Do you want to buy the outfit?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaid.LiveryPartParcel": "[pg][say:These are all the livery's part and parcel, so pray take any you may like. Ah, but 450 gems is what I will ask for, if you do.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaid.SewnInProfusion": "[pg][say:Hmm,] Marielle starts, [say:they were sewn in, ah, profusion not very long agone. A rather... peculiar incubus requested enough to outfit a hold whole, although lord of one, he was not.] She catches your look. [say:Well, he did pay a lordly sum, and upon that lengthful sennight's epilogue, 'twas all indeed he desired. And...] The seamstress twirls a stray lock of hair for a moment as she appears to search for something inside the chest, then reaches into it. [say:And, by small misprision, I did fashion a few overmany...] She fishes out a few more items: stockings, gloves, a frilly headpiece, and a few ribbons."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaid.SpotMaidDress": "You spot something black-and-white and pull it out. A black dress, with a white apron. You identify it as a uniform a maid would wear."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered.BackInDeliberately": "[pg]Back in, they push--deftly, deliberately--catching that deliciously prickling spot time and again as she settles into a steady, sensual rhythm, all while her other hands never let up their zealous ministrations. It proves futile to try and keep your voice in, so you close your eyes and let your pants and moans echo through the old temple alongside the wet squelching of Marielle's[if (!hascock) { avid}] fingering. It feels overwhelming, like being masturbated by two people at once. Her hands work you expertly, in ways only a skilled artisan could, and you tell her as much."
