  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered.TerriblySorryPardon": "[pg][say:[if (hascock) {Hmm? Oh.|Oh!}] Terribly sorry am I, [Master]. Prithee pardon my... mine unpropriety.] She bows low, giving you a generous view down her chest, though there is not much to see, with what little she has. Still, her pale nipples look rather cute.[if (!hascock) { And suspiciously prominent.}] A shame you don't feel like leaning forwards to reach them."
