  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.ExtractsHerself": "[pg]She eventually manages to extract herself from your satisfied womanhood and, with an absent mind, brings the dripping digits to her lips. As she idly licks off your sexual fluids however, her glazed eyes fall onto yours."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.FranticGirlRightens": "[pg][say:Ah!] The frantic girl rightens up and yanks her fingers out of herself. [say:I, ah... My sincerest apologies, [Master], I crave naught but thy forgiveness,] she hurries to plead, bowing low and smearing some of her hair with your juices."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.GaspingClimbDown": "[pg]Gasping for air, you finally climb down from that trembling mountain and prop yourself up. The deathless seamstress doesn't look as well-off yet; panting and slumped against your lower body, she remains unresponsive when you prod her flushed cheek, her occasionally twitching fingers still lodged inside you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.GetUpLookSpotless": "[pg]You get up and look her over. It seems she managed to keep the dress spotless; a little wrinkled, perhaps, but perfectly serviceable."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.ImaginaryTailWags": "[pg][say:Ah! Ah... Thank you, [Master]...] An imaginary, bushy tail wags behind her as she leans into your touch before righting herself again and coughing softly."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.NudgeOrScold": "You [if (corruption < 50) {nudge the masturbating maid|raise your voice at your selfish servant}]; she was supposed to pleasure you, and only you, has she already forgotten, you ask."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.OfCourseAnon": "[pg][say:Of course! Anon! Thank you, [Master].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.PetersOffCloth": "[pg][say:I-I, I...] Marielle peters off and jerks away to get a cloth instead, handing you one as well. You're sure she'd blush even deeper if that were at all possible."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.RewardForWorking": "[pg]You tell her she [if (corruption < 50) {will|might}] have that, if she gets back to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.ScramblesAttention": "[pg][say:Wha!] She hastily scrambles to attention, stumbling as she tries to stand on her wobbly legs."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.SpotlessSkirt": "[pg]Getting up and looking her over, you notice the maid dress is spotless, even the skirt. Though a little wrinkled now, it still looks fine to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.StrengthReturnsMaid": "[pg]Strength returns to you after a while, and you sit up. Your maid regards you with a mix of bliss and uncertainty. You could mistake her for a lost puppy right now. A satisfied smile crosses your face, and you tell her she did well, patting her head."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.UtterlySpentTable": "[pg]But everything must end. Utterly spent, you flop onto the table, narrowly avoiding a pincushion by sheer luck. You are barely aware when Marielle pulls out of you and licks your feminine juices off her fingers before she sidles closer and lovingly strokes your thighs."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingered2.WatchingTurnsOn": "Watching her getting herself off like this only turns you on even more. You suck in a sharp breath, and before you can even attempt to hold on, you are careened over the edge by a particularly enthusiastic plunge."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingeredYes.AllInOrderFit": "[pg][say:Well, all should be in order; I am quite certain 'twill now suit you to perfection. Howbeit, ah, if there be issues, hesitate not in calling.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingeredYes.CatchesSwiftness": "[pg][say:Huh? Wherefo-- Oh!] She catches them with surprising swiftness and springs into movement. [say:I will, ah, uhm...] Though as she glances at the desk stained by your fluids, she momentarily spaces out, collecting herself only a long second later and grabbing two measuring tapes and a cleaning cloth. [say:Pray allow me to make some, ah... adjustments... [Master],] she adds with a [if (hascock) {slight bow|coy smile that ends up looking rather awkward}]. You [if (hascock) {do let her take your sizes|let her take your sizes, noticing that she's being a good bit more physical than perhaps needed}], then leave her to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingeredYes.FishForGems": "You fish for your gems and toss Marielle the amount she asked for earlier."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidFingeredYes.LanguidlyWash": "[pg]Languidly, you [if (!isnakedlower) {re-dress|crack your neck}], wash yourself by one of the temple's clear puddles, and stretch. When you saunter back to the seamstress, she's just applying the finishing touches before handing you your new dress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.BuyAfterHandjob": "[pg]Do you want to buy it?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.ChillyTouch": "[pg]Her touch is chilly and almost makes you flinch as her hand rests on your hips. She kneels down in front of you, regarding you through her spectacles with equal parts hesitation and concentration. As her hand inches closer to its target, a second one joins in, cool fingers tickling you until they both reach the base and wrap around your length."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.CloseUnderAssault": "[pg]You are getting close under her triple assault. Through ragged breaths, you tell her as much."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.CurtlyBows": "[pg][say:...Yes, [Master], pray forgive me.] Marielle curtly bows to you and steps closer. [say:Let me, ah... make apology to you, [Master].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.FirstSpurtYelp": "[pg]Groaning in pleasure, you hear Marielle yelp as the first spurt of cum hits her right on the forehead, and she gracelessly fails to dodge the second one that quickly coats her glasses, robbing her of sight as sparks dance across your vision. Faltering, she regardless works you through your shuddering orgasm, the hot, electric passion racing through your veins amplified by her continuous, if now erratic, motions."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.GlancesUnderstanding": "[pg][say:Pardon m-- oh! Oh. I...] She glances at your [cock], finally understanding your intention. [say:Oh, uhm...] She doesn't seem too excited, though; you quietly wonder if she would turn you down. [say:Must we forsoo-- I mean, if 'tis not... I... I, uhm...] A long breath, not quite dispelling a look of aversion that she diverts from you down to her current livery."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.GlancesUpYes": "[pg][say:Huh?] She glances up at you. [say:Oh, ah, yes.] [if (hasvagina) {Nodding briefly|Shuffling away}] and knitting her brows, she then clamps down with both hands and pumps your length with surprising recklessness. Her fourth one finally leaves your tensed-up thigh and moves to gingerly caress your glans in stark contrast to her vice-tight grip below."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.GrumblesAbandon": "[pg][say:Hrmmgh,] Marielle grumbles, all to eager to abandon you and take off her soiled spectacles. [say:Needed it truly be the glasses...]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.IrritatedSmile": "[pg]She looks up at you, her irritated face forcing out a wholly unsuccessful smile. [say:I... hope 'twas to your pleasure, [Master].] You tell her it was; she sure has a way with her hands."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.KnowWhatWant": "Seeing her in this outfit, you know what you want her to do. You [if (!isnakedlower) {get your [armor] out of the way, exposing your crotch to the elements|toss your baggage aside}] and stride closer, eliciting a surprised step back from the seamstress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.LeansLowerArms": "[pg]Marielle leans in, her lower arms finding support on your thighs, and starts to work her thumbs across the underside of your dick. Despite the unnatural chill of her skin against yours, you quickly grow hard under her massaging fingers, helped by the loose maid's dress giving you an easy view down the girl's small chest, pale nipples only sporadically obstructed by swaying strands of golden hair. She studies your face with an almost piercing stare, trying to gauge your reactions and adding more pressure each time her cold, narrow digits pass over sensitive spots. Before long, your [cock] stands at full mast."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.MeasuredMotions": "[pg]Their motions measured, her hands slide up your length, collect pre-cum from your tingling crown, then slip down again with the added lubrication. Her movements seem inhuman, calculated, almost mechanical, the frigidity of Marielle's body adding to that impression, but the light breath occasionally brushing against you feels anything but. You lean back, content to let the seamstress-turned-maid jerk you off. Your heartbeat quickens as she steadily ups the tempo, pleasure rising, wet squelching sounds echoing through the old temple."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.QuartetSensations": "[pg]The quartet of sensations--her strong double-grasp, the slightly awkward massage of your tip, the fingers kneading your [if (hasvagina) {engorged lower lips|[if (hasballs) {churning balls|taint}]}], and her increasingly strained puffs of breath against your sensitive skin--soon has you clinging onto the edge. But your small maid shows no mercy, intent on casting you off the cliff. You grit your teeth and let go, throwing yourself to the waves."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.SitOnDesk": "[pg]You sit down on her desk, careful not to skewer yourself on any needles, and tell your little servant to get to work. Marielle looks at you, clearly confused, and you patiently watch the gears in her head working."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.SoftVoiceBleeding": "[pg][say:Yes. Yes, of course... [name].] Even as soft as Marielle's voice is, it's bleeding {0}, though it seems she wouldn't refuse a simple handjob, after all. Although, '[name]'? She should address you properly, if you're doing this.[if (!hasvagina) {{ At that, she nearly scowls at you, but apparently decides not to say what's on her tongue before letting go of a sigh.}}]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.SquintingCloth": "[pg]Looking her over--squinting and reaching for a cloth to try and clean your spunk off her face--you notice she miraculously managed to keep the dress spotless. With expertise like that, maybe she should become a bona fide maid. You keep that thought to yourself, though."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.SteelGazeStops": "[pg]There, she stops, her steel gaze evaluating your erect length as she tilts herself back a little. Apparently having decided on how to go on about this, she dips a third hand low to [if (hasvagina) {tease the lips of your neglected cunt|[if (hasballs) {cradle your [balls], massaging your needy orbs|massage the base of your dick, dipping even lower and over your taint}]}] as she looks into your eyes and resumes her previous handiwork with increased intensity."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.WhatAreYouDoing": "[pg][say:Ah! Uhm... [name]? What are you doing?]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjob.WindDownRelief": "[pg]You [if (cumquantity > 450) {eventually|soon}] wind down, much to the relief of the blind, sputtering seamstress, your [cock] slowly softening in her warmed-up grasp."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjobYes.AddsSlightBow": "[pg][say:I will, ah, need but a moment to adjust the dress for you... [Master],] she adds with a slight bow and quickly takes your sizes, narrowing her eyes to read the numbers before leaving to properly wash her face off."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjobYes.ExchangesDress": "[pg][say:Well, all is done, 'twill certainly fit you now,] she says, exchanging the dress for a bundle of gems. [say:Though, pray tell, should aught be amiss therewith.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjobYes.LooksUpCleaning": "[pg][say:Hmm?] Marielle looks up from her cleaning. [say:Oh. Oh! Ah, yes, of course.] She briefly checks the fabric for stains, then puts aside her glasses and picks up two measuring tapes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjobYes.RedressLetWork": "[pg]You [if (isnakedlower) {watch her }]re-dress, then let her get to work. It doesn't take her long to finish and wave you back."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidHandjobYes.ThinksBuyOutfit": "You think you'll buy that outfit."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.BuyMaidQuestion": "[pg]Do you want to buy it?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.FrownsFloridBlush": "[say:I...] She frowns at you, [if (femininity >= 59) {a faint, florid blush spreading across her face|evidently unsure what to say}]. A few moments of silence ensue, during which she hesitantly eyes the dress before releasing a quiet exhale."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.GingerlyTakesDress": "[pg]She gingerly takes the dress from your hands and turns around to quickly and efficiently swap it with her current one, patting down the skirt before facing you again."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.HabitNotIndignity": "[pg][say:Well, mayhap a maidservant's habit be not one of indignity...] she murmurs. [say:Very well, if you so wish.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.MaidservantBeMe": "[say:Once more, the maidservant be me...] Marielle murmurs[if (femininity >= 59) {, coloring faintly}] at your request. [say:Very well, if you wish it to be so, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.SlowTwirlAsks": "[pg][say:[if (femininity >= 59) {W-}]Well?] she asks with a slow twirl."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModel.SuitsHerBetter": "[pg]It suits her far better than she'd probably want to admit. The short, puffy sleeves strain under a pair of arms too many being squeezed through them, and in contrast is the fit quite loose around the chest, dangerously close to exposing her, but the large size does have a certain charm to it. Marielle fidgets in place as you admire her. The dress looks pretty good as well. There's more lace and ribbons than was initially apparent, giving it an almost fanciful though fashionably erotic look despite the relative modesty of the overall composition."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelNo.ChangesBackLook": "[pg]While she changes back into her usual dress, you take a look at the other clothes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelNo.DisappointedMoment": "[say:Oh, hmm...] She looks a little disappointed for a moment, but quickly collects herself. [say:Well, 'tis certainly no garment that contents just any a one's tastes.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelYes.AllOvertightTell": "[pg][say:There, that should be all. If aught yet sit overtight, pray tell me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelYes.BeckonsAdjustedDress": "[pg]After some time, she beckons you over, presenting you the adjusted maid's dress."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelYes.EagerlyShimmiesOut": "[pg][say:Ah, lovely!] she exclaims and eagerly shimmies out of the dress, giving you a brief look at her pale, naked back before she puts on her usual summer gown again. [say:'Twill require but a few, ah, alterations for you. Keep still awhile, please...] You do as told while she measures you with quick, professional motions, then adjusts her glasses and gets to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidModelYes.HandsGemsSmile": "You hand Marielle the gems, which she grasps with a smile on her face."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidNo.FoldsDressBack": "You fold the dress and put it back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidYes.AllDonePrayTell": "[pg][say:Well, that shall be all. Pray tell me, should aught be amiss.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidYes.HandsGems": "You hand over the gems."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidYes.HoldsStillTailor": "[pg][say:Ah, wonderful, then. I shall need but a moment to tailor it unto your person.] You hold still and let her take your measurements while she murmurs to herself, then takes the maid dress from you and sits down to get to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopMaidYes.SatisfiedHmm": "[pg]Before long, she gives a satisfied [say:Hmm] and returns the outfit to you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopModel.StrandBehindEar": "[pg][say:I...] Another strand disappears behind her ear. [say:I, ah... suppose that I could do.] That was a quicker and more positive response than you perhaps expected, so you ask if she's really fine with that. [say:Well, uhm, you... are not first to therefore implore me,] Marielle says[if (femininity >= 59) {, gaining a touch of color on her paleness}], [say:and from the dearth of a looking-glass proceeds discontent, I do concur. Alas, ill-fitted were such a one's weight to these travels mine, and, ah, sure to shiver upon the rugged roads would it be, besides. So, well... what with such lack, 'tis least of what I may do to fill its stead...] Seemingly drifting off, she lets the pause drag on before snapping herself back."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopModel.VestiaryAssistance": "[pg][say:Thus, well, if you be in need of vestiary assistance, you need but ask, and I shall be pleased to, ah, help.] A contemplative second later, she nudges her glasses up and adds, [say:Within due reason.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopModel.WonderIfSheModels": "Looking through your options, you wonder if she could model some of these for you. The travelling seamstress doesn't seem to be carrying any large mirrors with her, so that would be the next-best solution if you wanted to get an idea of what a specific piece looks like on an actual person. She glances up as you put forth your question, swiping back some hair and looking rather perplexed for a moment."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.PerksUpHosiery": "[pg][say:Ah,] Marielle says, perking up a little, [say:a piece of hosiery that truly stood and mastered the trials of time. Pantyhose, tights--its naming may bemuse one at times, but 'twill belike refer to this very selfsame item,] she explains, gesturing towards it. [say:'Tis a rather, ah, lengthsome process, knitting these, and one must take heed to tear them not in a moment too remiss.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.PullOutPantyhose": "You pull out a pair of pantyhose. They're straightforward and fairly simple: a thin, skin-tight leg garment. Although you do note that these seem to be exceedingly soft and smooth, much more so than what [if (isfeminine) {you were familiar with back home|some [if (ischild || isteen) {girls|women}] back home would wear}]."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.ReachesDownPullsPair": "[pg][say:Well, they are supposed to be worn with]--she reaches down and pulls a pair of panties out of the chest--[say:pretties. Underneath, that is. Although some [if (silly) {'people'|people}] would rather wear theirs above. Howbeit, well, you of course need not wear any soever, should you, ah, so desire.] She spreads the panties in question between her fingers and holds them out towards you. They look a little plain, but not in a negative sense--kinda cute and probably comfortable."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.SeventyGemsWithal": "[pg][say:70 gems, wish you to buy these withal, and 40 in the event you do not.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.StretchThemOut": "[pg]You stretch them out a bit. The fine, silky mesh looks delicate, but seems also elastic to some extent, so there probably isn't going to be much of an issue unless you abuse them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhose.WhatWillItBe": "[pg]What will it be?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseNo.PutsItemBack": "If Marielle is disappointed, she doesn't show it. You both put the item you're holding back into its place."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWith.BeckonsFinishedProduct": "[pg]Before long, she beckons you back and presents you the finished product."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWith.HandBothGems": "You hand Marielle the gems she wanted for both items."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWith.HopePleased": "[pg][say:I hope 'twill find you pleased. If aught be amiss, hesitate not to inform me.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWith.SearchesForTape": "[pg][say:Ah, lovely,] she says, then searches for a tape. [say:I will needs make some, ah, adjustments, so pray keep you still.] You do as told while she [if (isfemale) {swiftly but a bit tensely|quickly}] measures your hips and legs. Murmuring to herself, she squats down and reaches into the trunk to pull out another pair of pantyhose. [say:These ought be a much finer fit unto your frame, [name]. And prithee allow me but a minute.] You nod and go to take in the murky, mystical view of the bog around you for a bit."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWithout.HappilyTakesGems": "Marielle happily takes your gems, though she does cock an eyebrow when you tell her you won't need the panties."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopPantyhoseWithout.LeansToTheSide": "[pg][say:Hmm... is that so. Well, as you wish. But be that as it may]--she leans to the side to eye your [legs], then bends down to fish another pair of pantyhose out of the chest--[say:these shall be a fit much finer.] You trust her professional judgement."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydoll.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydoll.FiddlesPincushion": "[pg][say:I, uhm, well...] she starts, grabbing and fiddling with her pincushion. [say:Well, a 'babydoll' is what 'tis called. And, ah, this one is fashioned for, ah... the bedchamber. 'Tis a negligee.] She says that as if she expects you to know what it means and doesn't add anything more, falling into an awkward silence. In any case, it is quite light, so you suppose you could wear it in any situation, really, if the sheer fabric doesn't bother you."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydoll.FindFoldedSeeThrough": "You find something folded up that looks like it's entirely see-through, and you take it out. It indeed is--from its shoulder straps, to the chest-fitted top part, to the rest that flows loosely down the torso like a very short and frilly dress, this thing wouldn't leave much to the imagination at all."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydoll.QuietlyEyesYou": "[pg]Marielle has been quietly eyeing you, a look of what you think is slight embarrassment on her face. You ask her about the garment."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydoll.TwoHundredGems": "[pg][say:Uhm... 'tis 200 gems, wish you to purchase it.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydollNo.PutRacyBabydollBack": "You put the racy babydoll back into its compartment."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydollYes.BeckonsBabydollOver": "[pg]After a while, she beckons you over again and presents you the tailored babydoll."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydollYes.BuyThatOne": "You'll buy that one."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydollYes.ChoiceUnexpected": "[pg][say:Oh! Oh, yes, of course.] It sounds like your choice came a little unexpected, but she quickly puts down the pincushion and takes out a pair of measuring tapes. [say:'Twill but require a few alterations first. I bid you keep yourself still.] You let her take the necessary sizes, give her the money and garment, and let her get to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBabydollYes.ShouldFitWell": "[pg][say:Well, that should fit quite well, I ween. Though be there any, ah... discomfort, hesitate not to call.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBra.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBra.HundredFortyGems": "[pg][say:'Twould be, ah, 140 gems if you like to buy one.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBra.PullsUnfinishedLace": "[pg][say:Ah, well,] Marielle says, pulling on a strip of unfinished lace, [say:these have been rather... desired here within Mareth. 'Tis durable, of course, yet... well...] She gestures roughly in its direction. You guess she means it's quite risqué--you think that's a word she would choose."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBra.TakeOutSheerBra": "You take out a bra. On first glance, it looks fairly normal--if somewhat elaborate--but as you turn it to the light, you notice the fabric is fine enough to be see-through."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBraNo.PutTransparentBraBack": "You put the transparent bra back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBraYes.HandOverMoney": "You hand her the money."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBraYes.MinuteSatisfiedHmm": "[pg]It only takes her a minute before she leans back with a satisfied [say:Hmm] and presents you the finished bra."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBraYes.OughtFitRatherWell": "[pg][say:All is done, and this ought fit you rather well, now.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerBraYes.RummagesTape": "[pg][say:Oh, of course,] she says, rummaging around for a measuring tape. [say:Some small adjustments shall be necessary however...] After she has taken your relevant sizes, you let her work in silence."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPanties.DoYou": "[pg]Do you?"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPanties.HundredFortyGemsPair": "[pg][say:Well, I ask for 140 gems, like you to buy a pair.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPanties.PullOutSheerPanties": "You pull out a pair of panties. At first glance, they seem fairly normal, if intriguingly elaborate, but as the light shines onto them, you realize the fabric is fine enough to be entirely see-through. If you wore them, you'd be almost as exposed as without."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPanties.UnsureWhatToSay": "[pg][say:Ah, uhm...] Marielle seems unsure of what to say, fingers playing with themselves. [say:I, well... This manner of cloth is quite, ah... favored by the denizens of this realm. Thus, well, I...] [if (silly) {She probably means to say that she likes making money and these sell like hot cakes among the wanton sluts of Mareth.|You can imagine that these would find a few more buyers here than back in Ingnam or her own world.}] Stretching them a little, you find out the fabric isn't as flimsy as it at first appeared, so they shouldn't be much less reliable than any others."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPantiesNo.StowRacyPanties": "You stow the racy pair of panties back into the chest."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPantiesYes.OfCourseAdjust": "[say:Oh,] she says as you hand her the gems she asked for, [say:of course. I must needs make a few small adjustments aforehand, so... pray hold you still.] She takes out a tape and [if (isfemale) {a little hesitantly|quickly}] takes all the relevant measurements, then gets to work."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPantiesYes.PresentsFinishedPanties": "[pg]After less than a minute, she stands up from her stool and presents you the finished pair."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopSheerPantiesYes.QuiteAgreeable": "[pg][say:Well, these should be quite agreeable. And in case they be not so, pray tell.]"
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopStripes.BlueWhiteStripes": "Alternating bits of blue and white catch your eye, so you reach into the chest and fish the garment out. It's a pair of panties, striped horizontally. They seem fairly innocent and simple, yet fetching."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopStripes.CatalogueOfVariations": "[pg][say:These are the catalogue of variations I owe, I believe. The blue ones]--she waves the bra in question and points her free hand at the panties you're holding--[say:have always been a classic most adored, whereas the pink ones]--she holds the matching set aloft--[say:possess a more, ah, feminal semblance. Howbeit, both are quite charming, upon their own mien and manner,] she says before looking at you, perhaps a hint of expectancy in her bright-blue eyes."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopStripes.ChoiceBetweenFour": "[pg]It seems you're left with a choice between any of the four of them."
  "Scenes.Marielle.ShopStripes.FiftyGemsEach": "[pg][say:Ah, they are 50 gems each, wish you to buy one,] the girl finally adds."
